(5460103, 786619, 52130, '<td valign="top">hmm, I had to stare at this for a while (and not for the obvious reason). Don''t see too much that is artistic here and I''m pretty sure that the girl in the background looks like she wants to kick your ass. It also looks like this was done out of blatant drunkeness. That makes me wonder if you got her permission to put this online. A lot to wonder about here, but not to much to really see.</td>', 'hmm, I had to stare at this for a while (and not for the obvious reason). Don''t see too much that is artistic here and I''m pretty sure that the girl in the background looks like she wants to kick your ass. It also looks like this was done out of blatant drunkeness. That makes me wonder if you got her permission to put this online. A lot to wonder about here, but not to much to really see.', '2009-05-01 01:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
