(5460116, 786955, 75034, '<td valign="top">Jamie, this just isn''t fair to the rest of the entries. She is a talented model and you are a talented photographer. You bring out the best in each other. Another GREAT shot of Lilia and I trust not your last. I love the lighting and the intense focus in her eyes. The smooth lines of her hair frame her face beautifully. You can''t just pass by this shot without being captivated by her.<br/> <br/>Well done and I love it in B&amp;W, great choice.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Jamie, this just isn''t fair to the rest of the entries. She is a talented model and you are a talented photographer. You bring out the best in each other. Another GREAT shot of Lilia and I trust not your last. I love the lighting and the intense focus in her eyes. The smooth lines of her hair frame her face beautifully. You can''t just pass by this shot without being captivated by her. Well done and I love it in B&W, great choice. All the best to you and yours MAX!', '2009-05-01 01:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
