(5460401, 784998, 41142, '<td valign="top">Very impressively processed! I suspect that the original was rather ordinary-looking. The question is how much detail is retained in the full-res version I guess. I''ll give it a 10 :-)</td>', 'Very impressively processed! I suspect that the original was rather ordinary-looking. The question is how much detail is retained in the full-res version I guess. I''ll give it a 10 :-)', '2009-05-01 04:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460403, 779179, 41142, '<td valign="top">Uhm, I hope I''m not offending anyone here, but honestly I think the photograph would have had more impact if<br/>a) It was more saturated<br/>b) The models were a bit more attractive.<br/> <br/>The lit highlights on the models is also a bit blown.<br/> <br/>However, I like the fact that it makes you wonder about what the story behind this is. 6.</td>', 'Uhm, I hope I''m not offending anyone here, but honestly I think the photograph would have had more impact ifa) It was more saturatedb) The models were a bit more attractive. The lit highlights on the models is also a bit blown. However, I like the fact that it makes you wonder about what the story behind this is. 6.', '2009-05-01 04:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460404, 786548, 41142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Interesting camera angle, and great out-of-context shot makes this interesting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Interesting camera angle, and great out-of-context shot makes this interesting.', '2009-05-01 04:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460406, 783744, 41142, '<td valign="top">It''s unusual, but not really logically coherent.</td>', 'It''s unusual, but not really logically coherent.', '2009-05-01 04:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460407, 785974, 41142, '<td valign="top">I like the way in which you roughened his skin to enhance imperfections. Interesting angle, too.</td>', 'I like the way in which you roughened his skin to enhance imperfections. Interesting angle, too.', '2009-05-01 04:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460409, 786661, 41142, '<td valign="top">Shame that it''s noisy and a bit out of focus. Also the subject is too underexposed and difficult to see head-on. I think you need a better camera for this.</td>', 'Shame that it''s noisy and a bit out of focus. Also the subject is too underexposed and difficult to see head-on. I think you need a better camera for this.', '2009-05-01 04:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460410, 784780, 41142, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of emotion! I really like this.</td>', 'Lovely capture of emotion! I really like this.', '2009-05-01 04:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460416, 786799, 103032, '<td valign="top">The composition is great, the rows of tulips leads the viewer to the horizon.  All of the colors are fantastic; the greens are rich, the yellows and reds of the tulips are brilliant, the balloons are brilliant and compliment the flowers, and the blue tones of the sky are great with just enough clouds to add character to the sky.  I like this image because everything is sharp/focused and the colors are so vibrant.  There is a lot of visual interest in this image that I think compliment each other.  I compliment you on your keen eye for composition, and I''m sure making the effort to be at the right place and right time to capture this image.  This is one of my favorites of this challenge. 10</td>', 'The composition is great, the rows of tulips leads the viewer to the horizon.  All of the colors are fantastic; the greens are rich, the yellows and reds of the tulips are brilliant, the balloons are brilliant and compliment the flowers, and the blue tones of the sky are great with just enough clouds to add character to the sky.  I like this image because everything is sharp/focused and the colors are so vibrant.  There is a lot of visual interest in this image that I think compliment each other.  I compliment you on your keen eye for composition, and I''m sure making the effort to be at the right place and right time to capture this image.  This is one of my favorites of this challenge. 10', '2009-05-01 04:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460422, 784228, 36141, '<td valign="top">Hé, there''s a rule about entering the same photo in different challenges.<br/> <br/><b>You may not:</b> <br/>use the same original image in more than one challenge.</td>', 'Hé, there''s a rule about entering the same photo in different challenges. You may not: use the same original image in more than one challenge.', '2009-05-01 04:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460424, 784552, 103032, '<td valign="top">This image just makes me laugh, I love it.  The composition is perfect for the point of view.  Great focus.  Great capture as each cow seems to have it''s own "expression."</td>', 'This image just makes me laugh, I love it.  The composition is perfect for the point of view.  Great focus.  Great capture as each cow seems to have it''s own "expression."', '2009-05-01 04:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5460429, 785946, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great character study.  Well focused to see all of her features.  Composition is tight and well thought out to capture the cards in the reflection of her glasses.  Well done.</td>', 'Great character study.  Well focused to see all of her features.  Composition is tight and well thought out to capture the cards in the reflection of her glasses.  Well done.', '2009-05-01 04:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
