(5461134, 785409, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was symbolic, though not to themselves.  For themselves, it was just life, and love, as it was always meant to be. For themselves it was as natural as the tulip in the spring, as the bee on the tulip, as the honey from the bee.<br/> <br/>For themselves, it was beauty and wonder and feeling, and their love shone like the noon day sun and brightened their hearts.<br/> <br/>For themselves, they did not understand the symbolism of this specific moment, as they glided silently in front of a bastion of the old order. An order that would have, in a time not too distant, forbidden their love.<br/> <br/>Yet here they were, free as a pair of birds, flaunting that freedom in the face of what used to be a death sentence, and showing the world that it had, indeed, moved on.</td>', 'It was symbolic, though not to themselves.  For themselves, it was just life, and love, as it was always meant to be. For themselves it was as natural as the tulip in the spring, as the bee on the tulip, as the honey from the bee. For themselves, it was beauty and wonder and feeling, and their love shone like the noon day sun and brightened their hearts. For themselves, they did not understand the symbolism of this specific moment, as they glided silently in front of a bastion of the old order. An order that would have, in a time not too distant, forbidden their love. Yet here they were, free as a pair of birds, flaunting that freedom in the face of what used to be a death sentence, and showing the world that it had, indeed, moved on.', '2009-05-01 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461135, 779227, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''d say this succeeds conceptually, but technically it is dark and kind of flat.  Good eye for the scene, however.</td>', 'I''d say this succeeds conceptually, but technically it is dark and kind of flat.  Good eye for the scene, however.', '2009-05-01 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461138, 785668, 97166, '<td valign="top">Wilbur looked around and sighed. <br/> <br/>Once again he had been forced out of his warm bed in front of the fire at an ungodly time of morning.<br/> <br/>Once again he had been made to go running through the grasses and marshes to please his crazy master.<br/> <br/>Once again he had to sniff out the reeking stench of buckshot filled duck, so that said master could boast about his skills to his poker buddies.<br/> <br/>And what did he get out of it? What did he get for his tireless and thankless work? What did he...<br/> <br/>"Good boy Wilbur! Good boy, that''s my good boy, who''s a good doggie? Who''s my boy?"<br/> <br/>His master stroked his ears and rubbed his head and Wilbur instantly forgot all his lament and bounded off into the grasses.<br/> <br/>Oh yes. He''d forgotten. That''s what he got out of it. <br/> <br/>He was a GOOD dog!</td>', 'Wilbur looked around and sighed.  Once again he had been forced out of his warm bed in front of the fire at an ungodly time of morning. Once again he had been made to go running through the grasses and marshes to please his crazy master. Once again he had to sniff out the reeking stench of buckshot filled duck, so that said master could boast about his skills to his poker buddies. And what did he get out of it? What did he get for his tireless and thankless work? What did he... "Good boy Wilbur! Good boy, that''s my good boy, who''s a good doggie? Who''s my boy?" His master stroked his ears and rubbed his head and Wilbur instantly forgot all his lament and bounded off into the grasses. Oh yes. He''d forgotten. That''s what he got out of it.  He was a GOOD dog!', '2009-05-01 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461147, 786033, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461148, 784766, 97166, '<td valign="top">His aunt stood by as she got ready to bathe little Johnny. She had been called in unexpectedly a few nights ago, when things went from joy and happy expectation to worry and fear in the matter of a few moments.<br/> <br/>However, that fear was short-lived, and through some miracle little Johnny''s mother had given birth to the biggest baby ever born naturally to a living human.  True, she had to stay in hospital for awhile to recover, but the Guinness Book of Records had called, and the media had their feel-good story of the decade, and everything was going wonderfully for all involved.<br/> <br/>Well, wonderfully for everyone but Aunt Beth, who was looking up phone numbers for physio-therapists.  Not many people had to rock a 45 lb infant to sleep every few hours!</td>', 'His aunt stood by as she got ready to bathe little Johnny. She had been called in unexpectedly a few nights ago, when things went from joy and happy expectation to worry and fear in the matter of a few moments. However, that fear was short-lived, and through some miracle little Johnny''s mother had given birth to the biggest baby ever born naturally to a living human.  True, she had to stay in hospital for awhile to recover, but the Guinness Book of Records had called, and the media had their feel-good story of the decade, and everything was going wonderfully for all involved. Well, wonderfully for everyone but Aunt Beth, who was looking up phone numbers for physio-therapists.  Not many people had to rock a 45 lb infant to sleep every few hours!', '2009-05-01 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461149, 786765, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The over dark tree and foreground against a vivid sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The over dark tree and foreground against a vivid sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461152, 786811, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The offset is a little strong given the interesting expression and facial features. A slightly stronger angle exposing more face to the profile would have helped. Excellant demonstation of DOF control - great bokeh. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The offset is a little strong given the interesting expression and facial features. A slightly stronger angle exposing more face to the profile would have helped. Excellant demonstation of DOF control - great bokeh. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461154, 786943, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was a happy night that went down in infamy.<br/> <br/>It was Bruce Banner''s birthday, and he and his friends had decided to go out for Karaoke to let off a little steam and have a little fun. <br/> <br/>But it was while performing "Don''t Let the Sun Go Down on Me", that a group of drunk rabble-rousers entered the bar.  A group hell-bent on causing as much mischief as they could.  And when their taunts and cat-calls took on more and more personal notes, that Bruce began to get angry.<br/> <br/>They soon learned that they wouldn''t like it when Bruce gets angry.  Especially not when he''s singing Elton John for all he''s worth.</td>', 'It was a happy night that went down in infamy. It was Bruce Banner''s birthday, and he and his friends had decided to go out for Karaoke to let off a little steam and have a little fun.  But it was while performing "Don''t Let the Sun Go Down on Me", that a group of drunk rabble-rousers entered the bar.  A group hell-bent on causing as much mischief as they could.  And when their taunts and cat-calls took on more and more personal notes, that Bruce began to get angry. They soon learned that they wouldn''t like it when Bruce gets angry.  Especially not when he''s singing Elton John for all he''s worth.', '2009-05-01 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461155, 784781, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint this will have universal appeal. The use of color and grayscale, while a common technique, was used to good effect in this image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint this will have universal appeal. The use of color and grayscale, while a common technique, was used to good effect in this image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461159, 785886, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way and a terrific demonstration of DOF control and use of the zone system. From an artistic standpoint is has universal appeal - a gracefull sky along with a dramatic mountain landscape directly opposing the foreground gives a broad sense of depth and dimension. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should place within the top ten if not a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way and a terrific demonstration of DOF control and use of the zone system. From an artistic standpoint is has universal appeal - a gracefull sky along with a dramatic mountain landscape directly opposing the foreground gives a broad sense of depth and dimension. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should place within the top ten if not a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-05-01 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461165, 784069, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal to those who are not used to black and white exposures. Those who are should rate this image high. A little more exposure would have given it broader interest. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal to those who are not used to black and white exposures. Those who are should rate this image high. A little more exposure would have given it broader interest. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461170, 786776, 14867, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb, adding to the classic reflection theme something very dynamic</td>', 'Absolutely superb, adding to the classic reflection theme something very dynamic', '2009-05-01 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461174, 786888, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal to being overly tall and having the appearance of a composite image.. A crop of the bottom 1/3 of the image would have improved this image tremendously. The "model" technique is an interesting one. A very interesting entry into the challenge it should place well with those familiar with the technique. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal to being overly tall and having the appearance of a composite image.. A crop of the bottom 1/3 of the image would have improved this image tremendously. The "model" technique is an interesting one. A very interesting entry into the challenge it should place well with those familiar with the technique. Well done.', '2009-05-01 12:46:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5461179, 786528, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great job, speechless</td>', 'Great job, speechless', '2009-05-01 12:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461181, 786872, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp, properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the featureless dark areas. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp, properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the featureless dark areas. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461182, 784901, 61961, '<td valign="top">Adorable pup!</td>', 'Adorable pup!', '2009-05-01 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461186, 784889, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image with rich color and detail - a typical urban setting. A well thought out and applied title gives this image a very important wow factor and frames the author''s intent perfectly. A complete technical and artistic success. Given the subject matter, it may not have universal appeal, but it should place well in the challenge - within the top ten and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image with rich color and detail - a typical urban setting. A well thought out and applied title gives this image a very important wow factor and frames the author''s intent perfectly. A complete technical and artistic success. Given the subject matter, it may not have universal appeal, but it should place well in the challenge - within the top ten and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-05-01 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461189, 782470, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that properly framed and composed. From a technical standpoint, it''s a little flawed in that the object of the child''s delight is not in focus and the rather vague hand holding the object is lost in the background of the face - better DOF control would have been a plus. From an artistic standpoint it would have been a better choice to use a different angle centering the hand and object, or an alternative to that would have been to get higher and look down on the subject. Excellant use of the zone system to give the image some pop. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that properly framed and composed. From a technical standpoint, it''s a little flawed in that the object of the child''s delight is not in focus and the rather vague hand holding the object is lost in the background of the face - better DOF control would have been a plus. From an artistic standpoint it would have been a better choice to use a different angle centering the hand and object, or an alternative to that would have been to get higher and look down on the subject. Excellant use of the zone system to give the image some pop. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461199, 784919, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, richly detailed with all technical aspects controlled to perfection. Perfect color control that imparts depth and dimension along with pleasing tones and no detail is singularly over whelming - a complete and total artistic success. There there is justice in the world, this would be a blue ribbon winner and an all time favorite for many DPC participants. Significant wow factor and artistic impact. No superlatives are capable of expressing the excellance of this image. Well done.</td>', 'A beautiful image, richly detailed with all technical aspects controlled to perfection. Perfect color control that imparts depth and dimension along with pleasing tones and no detail is singularly over whelming - a complete and total artistic success. There there is justice in the world, this would be a blue ribbon winner and an all time favorite for many DPC participants. Significant wow factor and artistic impact. No superlatives are capable of expressing the excellance of this image. Well done.', '2009-05-01 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461200, 785941, 101256, '<td valign="top">Coming close to a previous image in the Motion challenge, this image has the same sense of humor perfectly imparted by it''s title and concept but it may lack universal appeal for the same reasons. A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint it''s high detail and color control is a huge plus. It should place well in the challenge - probably a top twenty image, a potential top ten and ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Coming close to a previous image in the Motion challenge, this image has the same sense of humor perfectly imparted by it''s title and concept but it may lack universal appeal for the same reasons. A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint it''s high detail and color control is a huge plus. It should place well in the challenge - probably a top twenty image, a potential top ten and ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-05-01 13:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461205, 786402, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because it takes too long to find the subject being located in the very right top corner - it is also much too small to have true artistic impact. A better choice might have been to change the title and crop out the plane and just go with the sky which is very dramatic. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because it takes too long to find the subject being located in the very right top corner - it is also much too small to have true artistic impact. A better choice might have been to change the title and crop out the plane and just go with the sky which is very dramatic. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 13:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461206, 786956, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. Excallant color control - green is a difficult color to properly handle. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. Excallant color control - green is a difficult color to properly handle. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 13:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461210, 783157, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but the bird in the tree affects the image in a indifferent way - some may like it, some may not. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but the bird in the tree affects the image in a indifferent way - some may like it, some may not. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 13:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461216, 786886, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way - perfect demonstration of lighting control and use of the zone system along with DOF control - a perfect conversion. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image being a character study. A very worthy entry into the challenge, it should place high. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way - perfect demonstration of lighting control and use of the zone system along with DOF control - a perfect conversion. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image being a character study. A very worthy entry into the challenge, it should place high. Well done.', '2009-05-01 13:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461220, 782261, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal - cute doesn''t always work well - this is right on the edge of not working well. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal - cute doesn''t always work well - this is right on the edge of not working well. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 13:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461230, 786876, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way with excellant color control and proper focus - the temptation might have been to use the offset with bokeh and that would not have been a good choie. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The featureless fog in the left corner, while a great concept, falls just shy of positively impacting the image which may be a negative for some viewers. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way with excellant color control and proper focus - the temptation might have been to use the offset with bokeh and that would not have been a good choie. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The featureless fog in the left corner, while a great concept, falls just shy of positively impacting the image which may be a negative for some viewers. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 13:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461238, 786793, 77192, '<td valign="top">This is a truly brilliant shot. I''m going to take a wild guess and say this is the acknowledged master of eagle shots, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32345" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alain</a> (IMO anyway). If this is not Alain, please take this as a sincere compliment.<br/> <br/>As you might seem from my portfolio, I''ve had a bit of success with eagle shots, but this is far better than anything I''ve ever done.<br/> <br/>(10 and faved)</td>', 'This is a truly brilliant shot. I''m going to take a wild guess and say this is the acknowledged master of eagle shots,  Alain (IMO anyway). If this is not Alain, please take this as a sincere compliment. As you might seem from my portfolio, I''ve had a bit of success with eagle shots, but this is far better than anything I''ve ever done. (10 and faved)', '2009-05-01 13:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
