(5461870, 785821, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  This is a perfect stop action.  The focus is incredible.</td>', 'Oh my.  This is a perfect stop action.  The focus is incredible.', '2009-05-01 17:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461872, 784883, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint the drama of the sky and different angle used to compose the image creates significant impact. A little more foreground than is necessary which keeps it from being truly perfect - a little less depth would have helped significantly - it is an outstanding effort. A top twenty image and potential top ten/ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint the drama of the sky and different angle used to compose the image creates significant impact. A little more foreground than is necessary which keeps it from being truly perfect - a little less depth would have helped significantly - it is an outstanding effort. A top twenty image and potential top ten/ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-05-01 17:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461877, 786691, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal as some might not understand the concept. A good use of bokeh, the image might have had more drama with a clearer background. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal as some might not understand the concept. A good use of bokeh, the image might have had more drama with a clearer background. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 17:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461883, 786714, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way - a perfect conversion to black and white. From an artistic standpoint, it is a terrific image but of less than universal appeal as some viewers might think it overly dark. A very good example of the zone system. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way - a perfect conversion to black and white. From an artistic standpoint, it is a terrific image but of less than universal appeal as some viewers might think it overly dark. A very good example of the zone system. Well done.', '2009-05-01 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461887, 786993, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely and winsome.</td>', 'Lovely and winsome.', '2009-05-01 17:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461890, 786849, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another excellant conversion producing a good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal and an excellant example of how the zone system impacts a good image and makes it better. A slight issue with the space at the right bottom - it could use a little sharper focus. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Another excellant conversion producing a good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal and an excellant example of how the zone system impacts a good image and makes it better. A slight issue with the space at the right bottom - it could use a little sharper focus. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 17:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461902, 786467, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461903, 786249, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success with one minor issue - on close examination, the subject on the right is slightly out of focus which is distacting along with the somewhat less than detailed subjects in the background.. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal.  A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success with one minor issue - on close examination, the subject on the right is slightly out of focus which is distacting along with the somewhat less than detailed subjects in the background.. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal.  A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 17:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461904, 785136, 101256, '<td valign="top">The over bloom on the sun along with the rather featureless and dull sky, foreground and middle ground makes this a rather less than interesting image - there is nothing to really attract the eye as it is immediately drawen to the over done sun. A little more exposure controlw would have helped the image tremendously. A good idea less than perfectly executed.</td>', 'The over bloom on the sun along with the rather featureless and dull sky, foreground and middle ground makes this a rather less than interesting image - there is nothing to really attract the eye as it is immediately drawen to the over done sun. A little more exposure controlw would have helped the image tremendously. A good idea less than perfectly executed.', '2009-05-01 17:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461941, 786974, 61961, '<td valign="top">Pretty reflections, good exposure, though the tilt hurts the photo.  Hard to compensate for lens distortion in these common cases.</td>', 'Pretty reflections, good exposure, though the tilt hurts the photo.  Hard to compensate for lens distortion in these common cases.', '2009-05-01 18:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461947, 785243, 68119, '<td valign="top">I would of love to have seen the eyes sharper and more in focas</td>', 'I would of love to have seen the eyes sharper and more in focas', '2009-05-01 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461979, 781058, 101256, '<td valign="top">A poignent image which is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint it is very effective demonstrating the rites of farewell - something that this reviewer can appreciate on a personal level. One minor issue with the partial exposure of the officers at the bottom of the image breaks up the geometry of the massed ranks that the author obviously tried so hard to achieve. A little bit of crop would have made this perfect. It works well as it is and should be a top finisher - certainly within the top fifteen. An excellant tribute image. Well done.</td>', 'A poignent image which is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint it is very effective demonstrating the rites of farewell - something that this reviewer can appreciate on a personal level. One minor issue with the partial exposure of the officers at the bottom of the image breaks up the geometry of the massed ranks that the author obviously tried so hard to achieve. A little bit of crop would have made this perfect. It works well as it is and should be a top finisher - certainly within the top fifteen. An excellant tribute image. Well done.', '2009-05-01 18:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461980, 786904, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, this style of close up portrait requires concentration and attention to detail and in this area, it has a rather significant flaw - the white shining through the hair on the right is a distraction and impacts the image negatively. If this issue had been seen when composing, it most likely would have been corrected making it a huge success. As it is, is has significant impact with excellant detail and highlight control - something not every photographer can properly capture and with the one issue corrected, it would have been perfect. A very good entry into the challenge and worthy of top fifteen placement and potentially a top ten.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, this style of close up portrait requires concentration and attention to detail and in this area, it has a rather significant flaw - the white shining through the hair on the right is a distraction and impacts the image negatively. If this issue had been seen when composing, it most likely would have been corrected making it a huge success. As it is, is has significant impact with excellant detail and highlight control - something not every photographer can properly capture and with the one issue corrected, it would have been perfect. A very good entry into the challenge and worthy of top fifteen placement and potentially a top ten.', '2009-05-01 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461981, 784100, 68119, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes but would of been a touch better if the whole face was on focas.</td>', 'Love the eyes but would of been a touch better if the whole face was on focas.', '2009-05-01 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461984, 783744, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image - a very good portrait of a hummingbird - rich in detail with good color and lighting management. Excellant bokeh with good vague detail. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image - a very good portrait of a hummingbird - rich in detail with good color and lighting management. Excellant bokeh with good vague detail. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 18:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461985, 786921, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success in terms of black and white conversion - good use of the zone system. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. This might have worked better as an oversharpened abstract with or without color. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success in terms of black and white conversion - good use of the zone system. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. This might have worked better as an oversharpened abstract with or without color. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461987, 786862, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image - a very good portrait of a magnificent animal - rich in detail with good color and lighting management. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image - a very good portrait of a magnificent animal - rich in detail with good color and lighting management. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 18:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461988, 782623, 101256, '<td valign="top">A competant image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is very dramatic with interesting details and a rather good mix of sky and cloud with the very slight color. An interesting image in that is has a grayscale feel to it - very unusual in a color photograph. Each image has to be evaluated on it''s own merits and while this is a pretty standard cityscape, it sets it''self apart due to it''s unigue presentation. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top ten image.</td>', 'A competant image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is very dramatic with interesting details and a rather good mix of sky and cloud with the very slight color. An interesting image in that is has a grayscale feel to it - very unusual in a color photograph. Each image has to be evaluated on it''s own merits and while this is a pretty standard cityscape, it sets it''self apart due to it''s unigue presentation. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top ten image.', '2009-05-01 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461989, 786847, 101256, '<td valign="top">Right on the edge of being oversharpened, this is a good solid commercial type of image image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, as previously stated, it has a certain appeal that is often found in professional portraits of children for special occasions. A very competant portrait and a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Right on the edge of being oversharpened, this is a good solid commercial type of image image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, as previously stated, it has a certain appeal that is often found in professional portraits of children for special occasions. A very competant portrait and a good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 18:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461990, 783224, 23484, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what anyone says, this is a very nice shot. I think the people in the picture really adds to it.</td>', 'I don''t care what anyone says, this is a very nice shot. I think the people in the picture really adds to it.', '2009-05-01 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5461992, 786973, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job at bringing out the detail in the yellow. That''s such a hard color to do that with.</td>', 'Great job at bringing out the detail in the yellow. That''s such a hard color to do that with.', '2009-05-01 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
