(5462024, 783841, 103818, '<td valign="top">The people and the beach itself are a little distracting, but the sky definitely makes up for it.</td>', 'The people and the beach itself are a little distracting, but the sky definitely makes up for it.', '2009-05-01 18:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462027, 783068, 101256, '<td valign="top">With properly controlled whites, this image has a very strong abstract feel to it while not being overly abstract in effect. A very good use of the natural curves of the vaulted ceiling and linear support structures. A wider angle lens would have helped this image as the left side is just slightly under focused in comparison to the right. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'With properly controlled whites, this image has a very strong abstract feel to it while not being overly abstract in effect. A very good use of the natural curves of the vaulted ceiling and linear support structures. A wider angle lens would have helped this image as the left side is just slightly under focused in comparison to the right. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462029, 786582, 32754, '<td valign="top">a little too much saturation</td>', 'a little too much saturation', '2009-05-01 18:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462062, 786307, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed it appears to be ever so slightly over sharpened - the edge detail on the subjects gives the image a composite look which is not a positive. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but the slight over done white bloom in the sunset is a negative. A little softer focus on the subjects would have been a plus in addition to a little better light control. Fill flash would have been a good choice. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed it appears to be ever so slightly over sharpened - the edge detail on the subjects gives the image a composite look which is not a positive. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but the slight over done white bloom in the sunset is a negative. A little softer focus on the subjects would have been a plus in addition to a little better light control. Fill flash would have been a good choice. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462068, 786590, 101256, '<td valign="top">Every time an image of one of these great apes is presented, one had to wonder what they are thinking. A great close in image, it appears to be a little over exposed resulting in a loss of the natural orange color. From a technical stanpoint, it is richly detailed, properly focused portrait. The artistic impact is good, just not as powerful as it could be. Worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Every time an image of one of these great apes is presented, one had to wonder what they are thinking. A great close in image, it appears to be a little over exposed resulting in a loss of the natural orange color. From a technical stanpoint, it is richly detailed, properly focused portrait. The artistic impact is good, just not as powerful as it could be. Worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462069, 786618, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462072, 786578, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is a very effective representation of historical reenactment. Rich detail is a plus even though the image is just slightly under exposed. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is a very effective representation of historical reenactment. Rich detail is a plus even though the image is just slightly under exposed. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462073, 784025, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462074, 785423, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462077, 786671, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success with some minor technical issues like over done whites. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal - a shorter exposure time might have helped this image and forestalled the effect of the boat movement in the foreground. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success with some minor technical issues like over done whites. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal - a shorter exposure time might have helped this image and forestalled the effect of the boat movement in the foreground. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462079, 786810, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way including properly controlled highlights. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image with the broad sweep of the shoreline reaching into the distance providing a sense of depth and dimension. A good entry into the challenge it falls just short of having significant pop and wow factor.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way including properly controlled highlights. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image with the broad sweep of the shoreline reaching into the distance providing a sense of depth and dimension. A good entry into the challenge it falls just short of having significant pop and wow factor.', '2009-05-01 19:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462080, 785244, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. The rather featureless sky negatively impacts the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462102, 781058, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I always wondered why that band of the hats is sitting just under their lips, is their a reason for? If you know you can pm me, I''m not voting this challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo. I always wondered why that band of the hats is sitting just under their lips, is their a reason for? If you know you can pm me, I''m not voting this challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462106, 786768, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed with some minor technical issues like the over done bloom which affects the dark figure by forcing a red bloom into the arm. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed with some minor technical issues like the over done bloom which affects the dark figure by forcing a red bloom into the arm. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462112, 786536, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing abstract image - a good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed using the medium of reflection - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of it''s abstract nature. However it affects this reviewer as the perfect abstract - a good eye for effective detail from the on the edge blue at the top to the cupola distortions, this is a simply brilliant image and could be considered a top flight homage to Lester Hayes. While it may not place well because of it''s unique nature, in this reviewer''s opinion, it should win a blue ribbon because of it''s unique and out of the ordinary viewpoint by comparison to other images in this challenge. A very welcome and uncommon image. Well done.</td>', 'A very intriguing abstract image - a good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed using the medium of reflection - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of it''s abstract nature. However it affects this reviewer as the perfect abstract - a good eye for effective detail from the on the edge blue at the top to the cupola distortions, this is a simply brilliant image and could be considered a top flight homage to Lester Hayes. While it may not place well because of it''s unique nature, in this reviewer''s opinion, it should win a blue ribbon because of it''s unique and out of the ordinary viewpoint by comparison to other images in this challenge. A very welcome and uncommon image. Well done.', '2009-05-01 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462115, 779380, 75699, '<td valign="top">Personally my eye is drawn to the huge dark area to the bottom right.  It throws the balance of the photo off. The idea is interesting, but perhaps consider cropping?</td>', 'Personally my eye is drawn to the huge dark area to the bottom right.  It throws the balance of the photo off. The idea is interesting, but perhaps consider cropping?', '2009-05-01 19:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462116, 786538, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - an excellant example of properly controlled lighting and camera control - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image demonstrating terrific use of the zone system, but of less than universal appeal for a variety of reasons having not to do with subject matter. A very different entry into the challenge and worthy of top ten placement if not a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - an excellant example of properly controlled lighting and camera control - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image demonstrating terrific use of the zone system, but of less than universal appeal for a variety of reasons having not to do with subject matter. A very different entry into the challenge and worthy of top ten placement if not a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-01 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462122, 780791, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image as the use of the just on the edge of over done white perfectly balance the darker tones - a very good use of white space in addition to being a excellant conversion to black and white.  A worthy entry into the challenge, it should place well into the top twenty if not the top ten. Well done.</td>', 'A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image as the use of the just on the edge of over done white perfectly balance the darker tones - a very good use of white space in addition to being a excellant conversion to black and white.  A worthy entry into the challenge, it should place well into the top twenty if not the top ten. Well done.', '2009-05-01 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462124, 785505, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of it''s rather flat color and appearance. Additionally, the foreground weed is a negative. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of it''s rather flat color and appearance. Additionally, the foreground weed is a negative. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462125, 786233, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 19:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462128, 786974, 75699, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!  There are some distractions, tho - the tree in the bottom right ruins the illusion that the building is part of the sky.  Also, I think there''s just a little too much plain blue on top.  Perhaps cropping would make more impact?</td>', 'I like this a lot!  There are some distractions, tho - the tree in the bottom right ruins the illusion that the building is part of the sky.  Also, I think there''s just a little too much plain blue on top.  Perhaps cropping would make more impact?', '2009-05-01 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462129, 779625, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this image is overly dark reducing details that would have increased it''s interest level. From an artistic standpoint it fails to impress for much the same reason along with the lack of depth and dimension. A difficult lighting situation that could have been handled better with a slightly different exposure setting</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this image is overly dark reducing details that would have increased it''s interest level. From an artistic standpoint it fails to impress for much the same reason along with the lack of depth and dimension. A difficult lighting situation that could have been handled better with a slightly different exposure setting', '2009-05-01 20:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462132, 786644, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image marred by a soft focus. The very dramatic sky and sun light on the copse is very effective. A little more time with properly choosing ISO, aperature and shutter speed would have made this a ribbon contender. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful image marred by a soft focus. The very dramatic sky and sun light on the copse is very effective. A little more time with properly choosing ISO, aperature and shutter speed would have made this a ribbon contender. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462135, 785890, 101256, '<td valign="top">An incredible image of Rochester, NY - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'An incredible image of Rochester, NY - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462136, 786793, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image is simply incredible - the detail and color is stunning - a complete technical success and from an artistic standpoint has a lot of impact. Superlatives fail to adequately describe the impression imparted by this close in look at a magnificent raptor. A blue ribbon winner.</td>', 'This image is simply incredible - the detail and color is stunning - a complete technical success and from an artistic standpoint has a lot of impact. Superlatives fail to adequately describe the impression imparted by this close in look at a magnificent raptor. A blue ribbon winner.', '2009-05-01 20:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462138, 782954, 101256, '<td valign="top">An incredible image - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'An incredible image - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462139, 784739, 101256, '<td valign="top">An incredible image - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'An incredible image - a complete technical and artistic success. This image has high impact and wow factor with it''s rich combination of color and detail with properly controlled highlights and lighting. A terrific demonstration of how to properly capture an image for maximum impact. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should win a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462142, 781699, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462144, 786868, 101256, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh - the initial impression is amazing - simply amazing. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact with rich color and with excellant detail in the foreground. This image would have worked as a black and white as well, but the treatment used is incredibly effective. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light, focus, motion tracking, composition and capture. Another top ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Oh my gosh - the initial impression is amazing - simply amazing. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact with rich color and with excellant detail in the foreground. This image would have worked as a black and white as well, but the treatment used is incredibly effective. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light, focus, motion tracking, composition and capture. Another top ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462147, 786676, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed with some minor technical issues like the over done bloom which affects the image by forcing a lens flare - they sometimes work and sometimes they don''t. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal due to it''s overly dark nature. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed with some minor technical issues like the over done bloom which affects the image by forcing a lens flare - they sometimes work and sometimes they don''t. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal due to it''s overly dark nature. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462150, 785923, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image in concept that could have used a wider angle lens and a little longer focus. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A competant grayscale conversion. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image in concept that could have used a wider angle lens and a little longer focus. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A competant grayscale conversion. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462164, 780486, 101256, '<td valign="top">The narrow center focus technique used in this image is becoming more common in these challenges, but in this case, is effective used. Rich detail, effectively controlled lighting, the visual impact is strong. A solid entry into the challenge, it should be a top ten image and possibly a ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'The narrow center focus technique used in this image is becoming more common in these challenges, but in this case, is effective used. Rich detail, effectively controlled lighting, the visual impact is strong. A solid entry into the challenge, it should be a top ten image and possibly a ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-05-01 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462165, 785580, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is properly framed and composed but suffers from a soft focus- a technical success with a minor flaw. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal.A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is properly framed and composed but suffers from a soft focus- a technical success with a minor flaw. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal.A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462169, 784100, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is properly framed and composed with appropriately detailed subject matter - a couple of minor technical issues like the reflections in the eyes and the soft fade on the right do not impact the image in a major way - a technical success with minor flaws. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal other than the "baby factor". A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is properly framed and composed with appropriately detailed subject matter - a couple of minor technical issues like the reflections in the eyes and the soft fade on the right do not impact the image in a major way - a technical success with minor flaws. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal other than the "baby factor". A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462172, 786964, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462173, 784558, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way presented in a very good conversion format. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way presented in a very good conversion format. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462191, 783876, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Last time i was here we were prevented from walking the trail because the military was conducting live fire exercises.</td>', 'Beautiful. Last time i was here we were prevented from walking the trail because the military was conducting live fire exercises.', '2009-05-01 20:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462199, 786163, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Is that the big dipper, too?</td>', 'Interesting photo. Is that the big dipper, too?', '2009-05-01 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462206, 786459, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-01 20:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462211, 784212, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve shot lots of photos from here, some have even done well in the challenges. I like that you included Qwest field. And I like the flow of traffic that leads me into the city. Well done!</td>', 'I''ve shot lots of photos from here, some have even done well in the challenges. I like that you included Qwest field. And I like the flow of traffic that leads me into the city. Well done!', '2009-05-01 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462238, 786427, 18197, '<td valign="top">You hooked me with this one. Lovely composition ... and I really like the "hook" in the flower.</td>', 'You hooked me with this one. Lovely composition ... and I really like the "hook" in the flower.', '2009-05-01 21:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462240, 780500, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lighting on this is superb. It sets the tone for the rest of the image wonderfully. And with you title, it makes me wonder about the back story. Well done.</td>', 'Lighting on this is superb. It sets the tone for the rest of the image wonderfully. And with you title, it makes me wonder about the back story. Well done.', '2009-05-01 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462241, 783068, 18197, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary composition. Repeating pattern is very strong. Among best in class.</td>', 'Extraordinary composition. Repeating pattern is very strong. Among best in class.', '2009-05-01 21:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462243, 786776, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for intelligent architecture photos and this qualifies. Very very well done.</td>', 'I am a sucker for intelligent architecture photos and this qualifies. Very very well done.', '2009-05-01 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5462244, 786992, 18197, '<td valign="top">This photo succeeds because it isn''t of a perfect model, who isn''t perfectly made up,  but rather is well composed, lit, shot, prepared and gives me an emotional sense of who the person is. So well done, I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'This photo succeeds because it isn''t of a perfect model, who isn''t perfectly made up,  but rather is well composed, lit, shot, prepared and gives me an emotional sense of who the person is. So well done, I hope it ribbons.', '2009-05-01 21:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462246, 780791, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lots of weddings this month I guess, but none better photographed than this one. B&amp;W a good choice. Centered comp works well. Lighting superb. And it''s a pleasing, memory fixing, photo the bride and groom ought to cherish forever.</td>', 'Lots of weddings this month I guess, but none better photographed than this one. B&W a good choice. Centered comp works well. Lighting superb. And it''s a pleasing, memory fixing, photo the bride and groom ought to cherish forever.', '2009-05-01 21:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462249, 783568, 18197, '<td valign="top">The lighting emphasizes the female form and musculature in a way that would make Leonardo or Michaelangelo proud.</td>', 'The lighting emphasizes the female form and musculature in a way that would make Leonardo or Michaelangelo proud.', '2009-05-01 21:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5462256, 786233, 65234, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!!  Technicals are all well and good ... OK might have cropped out the red thingy on top and a little more on the left ... but that expression is positively hysterical!!  Had to fave it :-).</td>', 'ROFL!!!  Technicals are all well and good ... OK might have cropped out the red thingy on top and a little more on the left ... but that expression is positively hysterical!!  Had to fave it :-).', '2009-05-01 21:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
