(5462352, 786776, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstracts are good and there is some strong competition for good ones in this challenge. Another image that intentionally or not, is very evocative of Lester Hayes and some more modern abstract photographers. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus and the artistic effects of good, strong abstract photography. While probably not to everyone''s taste at DPC, this reviewer appreciates abstract photography and score this as one of the best ever seen. Well done.</td>', 'Abstracts are good and there is some strong competition for good ones in this challenge. Another image that intentionally or not, is very evocative of Lester Hayes and some more modern abstract photographers. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus and the artistic effects of good, strong abstract photography. While probably not to everyone''s taste at DPC, this reviewer appreciates abstract photography and score this as one of the best ever seen. Well done.', '2009-05-01 22:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
