(5463175, 785269, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Interesting to see someone who looks so "tough" holding something so tender. Center composition and 3/4 lenght work well. This would make a great series if you added some close ups of the baby''s face with tattoos visible and maybe the two faces close to each other. Of course I know this contest isn''t about a series of photos... just offering suggestions.</td>', 'Great shot! Interesting to see someone who looks so "tough" holding something so tender. Center composition and 3/4 lenght work well. This would make a great series if you added some close ups of the baby''s face with tattoos visible and maybe the two faces close to each other. Of course I know this contest isn''t about a series of photos... just offering suggestions.', '2009-05-02 07:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463177, 785463, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great even lighting. Nice detail. It looks a little tilted to the left which is distracting.</td>', 'Great even lighting. Nice detail. It looks a little tilted to the left which is distracting.', '2009-05-02 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463180, 786765, 32011, '<td valign="top">Colours in this are stunning.  I like the silhouette of the tree, and how the border compliments it.  I''m not a fan of the electricity pylon in the background and the tilted horizon... perhaps a different crop might have helped to eliminated these... just a thought.  Colours are brilliant though, and I love the streaks of light coming through the clouds.</td>', 'Colours in this are stunning.  I like the silhouette of the tree, and how the border compliments it.  I''m not a fan of the electricity pylon in the background and the tilted horizon... perhaps a different crop might have helped to eliminated these... just a thought.  Colours are brilliant though, and I love the streaks of light coming through the clouds.', '2009-05-02 08:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
