(5463749, 786614, 41142, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle to a (for me) familiar sight. I''ll give it a 9. :-) Nice the way in which the remaining natural and artificial light has been combined.</td>', 'Interesting angle to a (for me) familiar sight. I''ll give it a 9. :-) Nice the way in which the remaining natural and artificial light has been combined.', '2009-05-02 12:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463753, 782470, 41142, '<td valign="top">The selective editing edges on introducing new elements into the image which weren''t present in the original? But nicely done. Lot''s of emotional appeal.</td>', 'The selective editing edges on introducing new elements into the image which weren''t present in the original? But nicely done. Lot''s of emotional appeal.', '2009-05-02 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463755, 786603, 41142, '<td valign="top">This waaaaaay to much post-processing to my liking. Binary is a bit too minimal.</td>', 'This waaaaaay to much post-processing to my liking. Binary is a bit too minimal.', '2009-05-02 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463763, 786233, 41142, '<td valign="top">Haha! Great anthropomorphism! LOL.9.</td>', 'Haha! Great anthropomorphism! LOL.9.', '2009-05-02 13:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463766, 783137, 41142, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background are too much in focus - it distracts from the tulips.</td>', 'The trees in the background are too much in focus - it distracts from the tulips.', '2009-05-02 13:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463772, 786977, 63152, '<td valign="top">I really liked the thumbnail but clicking through it''s a little bit too sharp for me I think.<br/> <br/>The shadows and the fence are gorgeous and the composition really works but the texture of the sand doesn''t really work for me, I''d want it to be smoother instead of the one dimensional sandpaper look.<br/> <br/>It''s still a solid photo though. Also I am very well aware that the exact quality of the sand isn''t under your control. A slightly different post processing might have changed the effect a bit though.</td>', 'I really liked the thumbnail but clicking through it''s a little bit too sharp for me I think. The shadows and the fence are gorgeous and the composition really works but the texture of the sand doesn''t really work for me, I''d want it to be smoother instead of the one dimensional sandpaper look. It''s still a solid photo though. Also I am very well aware that the exact quality of the sand isn''t under your control. A slightly different post processing might have changed the effect a bit though.', '2009-05-02 13:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463773, 785749, 41142, '<td valign="top">The photo lacks a bit of sharpness. The glass also doesn''t stand out from the table clearly enough for that great "pop" which IreneM (for example) is famous for.</td>', 'The photo lacks a bit of sharpness. The glass also doesn''t stand out from the table clearly enough for that great "pop" which IreneM (for example) is famous for.', '2009-05-02 13:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463774, 786767, 63152, '<td valign="top">Awww, this is a beautiful moment</td>', 'Awww, this is a beautiful moment', '2009-05-02 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463776, 785712, 41142, '<td valign="top">Very nice. But a bit out of focus? Especially top-left and bottom-right. I would''ve cropped or tried to get it sharper.</td>', 'Very nice. But a bit out of focus? Especially top-left and bottom-right. I would''ve cropped or tried to get it sharper.', '2009-05-02 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463778, 786589, 63152, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset and shapes, however the photo feels ever so slightly lopsided for me. I think it''s that the strong and simple central composition makes me want the sun to fit into that frame and be centered as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset and shapes, however the photo feels ever so slightly lopsided for me. I think it''s that the strong and simple central composition makes me want the sun to fit into that frame and be centered as well.', '2009-05-02 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463780, 785946, 41142, '<td valign="top">Original, and well lit. I like it for its originality. 9.</td>', 'Original, and well lit. I like it for its originality. 9.', '2009-05-02 13:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463783, 781699, 63152, '<td valign="top">These are pretty, the flowers feel very 3d so good job with the lighting to get that effect</td>', 'These are pretty, the flowers feel very 3d so good job with the lighting to get that effect', '2009-05-02 13:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463785, 782193, 41142, '<td valign="top">A very emotional subject to attempt. That''s quite brave. Or exploitational. But I''d vote for brave, in this case. 8.</td>', 'A very emotional subject to attempt. That''s quite brave. Or exploitational. But I''d vote for brave, in this case. 8.', '2009-05-02 13:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
