(5464402, 786717, 8713, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this maybe with the grass cropped out. Just my opinion. Still like the shot though. Clever title. :-)</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this maybe with the grass cropped out. Just my opinion. Still like the shot though. Clever title. :-)', '2009-05-02 20:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464444, 786582, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that appears to be slightly over saturated - the whole image has a slightly unnatural appearance. Interesting in that everything appears to be well controlled, it just isn''t that effective a presentation lacking general appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image that appears to be slightly over saturated - the whole image has a slightly unnatural appearance. Interesting in that everything appears to be well controlled, it just isn''t that effective a presentation lacking general appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464445, 786599, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal being overly large with a lot of empty and/or uninteresting space. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal being overly large with a lot of empty and/or uninteresting space. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464446, 784425, 101256, '<td valign="top">The gain effect is very dreamlike and an unusual application - much like early Civil war images only in color. The attempt to recreate the times using ISO and grain is a very good idea and in this case, it appears to have been a success. While some may view this as a huge mistake, it does work and combined with the action imparts a feeling of history viewed through a time machine. Probably not a high score image, in this reviewer''s opinion, it is a unigue and very different way of processing for effect and in that sense, it works in fine fashion. Well done.</td>', 'The gain effect is very dreamlike and an unusual application - much like early Civil war images only in color. The attempt to recreate the times using ISO and grain is a very good idea and in this case, it appears to have been a success. While some may view this as a huge mistake, it does work and combined with the action imparts a feeling of history viewed through a time machine. Probably not a high score image, in this reviewer''s opinion, it is a unigue and very different way of processing for effect and in that sense, it works in fine fashion. Well done.', '2009-05-02 21:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464447, 783224, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the rather empty nature of the image. A good look from behind the catamaran towards the subjects, or a closer look at the catamaran towards the water would have been a better choice. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the rather empty nature of the image. A good look from behind the catamaran towards the subjects, or a closer look at the catamaran towards the water would have been a better choice. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464449, 786990, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks interest being one of many images of a similar nature taken from a similar position. It might have been more interesting if, for instance, the author could have gotten below the bridge or at an angle were the bridge stood out more from the background as they are similar in tone. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it lacks interest being one of many images of a similar nature taken from a similar position. It might have been more interesting if, for instance, the author could have gotten below the bridge or at an angle were the bridge stood out more from the background as they are similar in tone. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464452, 786065, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image which could be viewed as a technical failure. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image with a dream like quality that is very effective - perhaps not of universal appeal - but that''s how is seems to be presented. This isn''t an abstract as much as it is more an impressionist concept in the mold of a classical period Claude Monet or modern era Thomas Dewing. If viewed by someone with an art background, this should place high.</td>', 'A good image which could be viewed as a technical failure. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image with a dream like quality that is very effective - perhaps not of universal appeal - but that''s how is seems to be presented. This isn''t an abstract as much as it is more an impressionist concept in the mold of a classical period Claude Monet or modern era Thomas Dewing. If viewed by someone with an art background, this should place high.', '2009-05-02 21:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464453, 786808, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal as it mimics a lot of macro images seen in numerous forums and photography expositions. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal as it mimics a lot of macro images seen in numerous forums and photography expositions. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464457, 786499, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort that lacks several elements of being technically successful, but the most glaring is the lack of proper focus to bring out the detail of the bee. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but is fails to have any significant artistic impact. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good effort that lacks several elements of being technically successful, but the most glaring is the lack of proper focus to bring out the detail of the bee. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but is fails to have any significant artistic impact. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464458, 779468, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-02 21:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
