(5464560, 786531, 66515, '<td valign="top">really tough scene to expose for. I think in this case you have to either shoot multiple exposures and use HDR or make a choice. Keep the detail in the highlights or try to get the detail in the shadows. With the sky you have I would have tried to hold the detail in the highlights.</td>', 'really tough scene to expose for. I think in this case you have to either shoot multiple exposures and use HDR or make a choice. Keep the detail in the highlights or try to get the detail in the shadows. With the sky you have I would have tried to hold the detail in the highlights.', '2009-05-02 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
