(5465281, 786402, 102811, '<td valign="top">An amazing skyscape that works very well in B&amp;W. The title kept me looking for the plane and it took a while to find it. The image would work perfectly well without the plane too. Good luck for the remainder of the challenge.</td>', 'An amazing skyscape that works very well in B&W. The title kept me looking for the plane and it took a while to find it. The image would work perfectly well without the plane too. Good luck for the remainder of the challenge.', '2009-05-03 11:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465284, 786233, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Love the emotion, tones and textures! I can see this on the office wall... "Another Meeting?" or "Monday Again?" Adorable! Making it a fav.</td>', 'Great capture! Love the emotion, tones and textures! I can see this on the office wall... "Another Meeting?" or "Monday Again?" Adorable! Making it a fav.', '2009-05-03 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465286, 784552, 60698, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Love it! The composition is perfect!</td>', 'Hahaha! Love it! The composition is perfect!', '2009-05-03 11:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465287, 786848, 60698, '<td valign="top">Such a happy, natural photo! Love it!</td>', 'Such a happy, natural photo! Love it!', '2009-05-03 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465306, 784850, 102581, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful.</td>', 'This is just beautiful.', '2009-05-03 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465307, 783068, 102581, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2009-05-03 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465325, 784315, 102581, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at...  The red pops, but over all I can''t score this to high.  Sorry and good luck.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at...  The red pops, but over all I can''t score this to high.  Sorry and good luck.', '2009-05-03 12:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465333, 782880, 102581, '<td valign="top">I really like the light in this photo, but for me, the composition is a bit lacking.  Someone gave me some advice on one of my photo''s -<br/> <br/><i>Just from what I''ve read though, there is one main thing here you want to avoid. A centered horizon. The better landscape shots have the horizon less centered in the shot. There is either more ground, or more sky, and there''s always some kind of focal point. Something to look at, which is offered in a way which leads to viewer to expand their vision to the rest of the photo. </i> <br/> <br/>I started changing up my horizon point and it does make more interesting pictures.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like the light in this photo, but for me, the composition is a bit lacking.  Someone gave me some advice on one of my photo''s - Just from what I''ve read though, there is one main thing here you want to avoid. A centered horizon. The better landscape shots have the horizon less centered in the shot. There is either more ground, or more sky, and there''s always some kind of focal point. Something to look at, which is offered in a way which leads to viewer to expand their vision to the rest of the photo.   I started changing up my horizon point and it does make more interesting pictures.  Good luck.', '2009-05-03 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465336, 784228, 102581, '<td valign="top">Woah...  This would have been good "Nightmares"!!!!</td>', 'Woah...  This would have been good "Nightmares"!!!!', '2009-05-03 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465337, 784495, 102811, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful beautiful image (so good I said it twice!)Well done and best of luck for the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'What a beautiful beautiful image (so good I said it twice!)Well done and best of luck for the rest of the challenge.', '2009-05-03 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465340, 780106, 102581, '<td valign="top">Good thought but I think you may have missed the mark.  The composition is lacking.  I think the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good thought but I think you may have missed the mark.  The composition is lacking.  I think the background is a bit distracting.', '2009-05-03 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
