(5465380, 786616, 106109, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2009-05-03 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465385, 784759, 106109, '<td valign="top">Even ugly can be pretty.</td>', 'Even ugly can be pretty.', '2009-05-03 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465386, 786194, 102811, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous. I would love to read a ''how to'' guide for this picture. It would be very very helpful for a Photoshop novice like me. Stunning and best of luck for the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous. I would love to read a ''how to'' guide for this picture. It would be very very helpful for a Photoshop novice like me. Stunning and best of luck for the rest of the challenge.', '2009-05-03 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465453, 783245, 81362, '<td valign="top">Water splash captured with good droplets stopped in mid air. A bit of post processing adjustment to brighten the whites and boost contrast, perhapswith a tweak to reduce the blue cast would help. The angle between the camera and subject suggests an image captured while staniding upright. Consider crouching down for a more dramatic perspective.</td>', 'Water splash captured with good droplets stopped in mid air. A bit of post processing adjustment to brighten the whites and boost contrast, perhapswith a tweak to reduce the blue cast would help. The angle between the camera and subject suggests an image captured while staniding upright. Consider crouching down for a more dramatic perspective.', '2009-05-03 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465454, 786652, 81362, '<td valign="top">Light appears to be from on-camera flash, making shadows harsh. Will make a nice family album memory, but could be improved for a challenge. Consider adjusting white balance and brightness to make the whites of the eyes whiter, and perhaps clone out the brown and black items from the background. Consider adding a diffuser to the flash, or, if camera allows, bouncing the flash off the ceiling (interim measures until able to practice with off camera flash).</td>', 'Light appears to be from on-camera flash, making shadows harsh. Will make a nice family album memory, but could be improved for a challenge. Consider adjusting white balance and brightness to make the whites of the eyes whiter, and perhaps clone out the brown and black items from the background. Consider adding a diffuser to the flash, or, if camera allows, bouncing the flash off the ceiling (interim measures until able to practice with off camera flash).', '2009-05-03 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465458, 784425, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice variety of action in this reenactment image. Near the center of the image we have a distracting patch of bright color with magenta/green/orange speckles, consistent with chroma noise also seen in the blue coats and grass. I wonder if this is associated with a high ISO setting that might have been lower with a wider apeture and different shutter speed. Consider a salvage attempt with one of the many available noise reduction software approaches.</td>', 'Nice variety of action in this reenactment image. Near the center of the image we have a distracting patch of bright color with magenta/green/orange speckles, consistent with chroma noise also seen in the blue coats and grass. I wonder if this is associated with a high ISO setting that might have been lower with a wider apeture and different shutter speed. Consider a salvage attempt with one of the many available noise reduction software approaches.', '2009-05-03 13:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465459, 784228, 81362, '<td valign="top">This is very similar to the recent "Nightmare" challenge blue ribbon entry, perhaps with higher quality processing. I would expect a fair number of low votes based on this no longer being fresh and original but instead a revisit of a previously successful image. This version might be better for a print than the earlier version, but the grim content would probably limit sales.</td>', 'This is very similar to the recent "Nightmare" challenge blue ribbon entry, perhaps with higher quality processing. I would expect a fair number of low votes based on this no longer being fresh and original but instead a revisit of a previously successful image. This version might be better for a print than the earlier version, but the grim content would probably limit sales.', '2009-05-03 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465460, 782104, 102811, '<td valign="top">An interesting and original still life that is technically superb and beautifully lit. I hope the other voters see the charm in this a 9 from me.</td>', 'An interesting and original still life that is technically superb and beautifully lit. I hope the other voters see the charm in this a 9 from me.', '2009-05-03 13:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465472, 786799, 102811, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly beautiful image in just about everyway. I really hope it gets the recognition it deserves. 10</td>', 'This is an incredibly beautiful image in just about everyway. I really hope it gets the recognition it deserves. 10', '2009-05-03 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465480, 783629, 81362, '<td valign="top">Chance juxtaposition of mallard and wood duck noted. Unfortunately, the background is very distracting with the scattered high contrast dead leaves and the green bits of needle branches competing for attention. Perhaps selective partial desaturation and darkening of all the image aside from the ducks (and maybe duck reflection) might help some.</td>', 'Chance juxtaposition of mallard and wood duck noted. Unfortunately, the background is very distracting with the scattered high contrast dead leaves and the green bits of needle branches competing for attention. Perhaps selective partial desaturation and darkening of all the image aside from the ducks (and maybe duck reflection) might help some.', '2009-05-03 13:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465484, 784901, 81362, '<td valign="top">Soft puppy has appeal, but it might help to crop away the dark patch at lower left (hind haunch?) and to use post processing techniques to make the background less distracting.</td>', 'Soft puppy has appeal, but it might help to crop away the dark patch at lower left (hind haunch?) and to use post processing techniques to make the background less distracting.', '2009-05-03 13:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465487, 783507, 81362, '<td valign="top">Dead center composition seems weak in this case because the image area aside from the main subject are not very interesting. Consider a mcuh closer crop, and perhaps a color balance adjustment to reduce what to my eyes appears to be a mild magenta color cast.</td>', 'Dead center composition seems weak in this case because the image area aside from the main subject are not very interesting. Consider a mcuh closer crop, and perhaps a color balance adjustment to reduce what to my eyes appears to be a mild magenta color cast.', '2009-05-03 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465490, 785981, 81362, '<td valign="top">Peaceful impression. I get the feeling of competition for subject matter. If the boat is important, having it as a bigger part of the composition would help. If it is not important, waiting a little bit unitl it is gone then backing up a bit to get a full reflection (in calmer water) would be a valid alternative.</td>', 'Peaceful impression. I get the feeling of competition for subject matter. If the boat is important, having it as a bigger part of the composition would help. If it is not important, waiting a little bit unitl it is gone then backing up a bit to get a full reflection (in calmer water) would be a valid alternative.', '2009-05-03 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465494, 785886, 102811, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, Ansell Adams himself would have been proud of this one. I hope the votors agree. Best of luck for the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'Stunning image, Ansell Adams himself would have been proud of this one. I hope the votors agree. Best of luck for the rest of the challenge.', '2009-05-03 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465496, 784491, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice set of curving green forms in the main subject. Background seems oversaturated, and recent run of challenge entries using green snakes like this one reduce the sense of originality.</td>', 'Nice set of curving green forms in the main subject. Background seems oversaturated, and recent run of challenge entries using green snakes like this one reduce the sense of originality.', '2009-05-03 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465508, 785393, 81362, '<td valign="top">After absorbing the title and looking a while, I see where the idea of a sweet image is lurking. However, shallow depth of field and lack of color clues makes it hard for the actual image to convey the intent.</td>', 'After absorbing the title and looking a while, I see where the idea of a sweet image is lurking. However, shallow depth of field and lack of color clues makes it hard for the actual image to convey the intent.', '2009-05-03 13:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465510, 786863, 81362, '<td valign="top">The colors and water droplets are nice. It might be worthwhile experimenting with different positions to separate the flowers more and maybe increase depth of field a little.</td>', 'The colors and water droplets are nice. It might be worthwhile experimenting with different positions to separate the flowers more and maybe increase depth of field a little.', '2009-05-03 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465529, 783224, 81362, '<td valign="top">The light blue sky, darker water, paler beach, and diagonal shoreline go well with the boat. Moving to the left, if possible, to shift the dark branches away from the boat might be an improvement. I see the walking people as a distraction in a potentially more artistic image.</td>', 'The light blue sky, darker water, paler beach, and diagonal shoreline go well with the boat. Moving to the left, if possible, to shift the dark branches away from the boat might be an improvement. I see the walking people as a distraction in a potentially more artistic image.', '2009-05-03 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465532, 786976, 81362, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential image subjects here. Not sure they all hang together very well.</td>', 'Lots of potential image subjects here. Not sure they all hang together very well.', '2009-05-03 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465545, 784100, 81362, '<td valign="top">Eye color so strikingly different from normal that the resulting image is rather disturbing. Was that boosted in post processing? I wonder if a different blanket with less prominent texture would be an improvement.</td>', 'Eye color so strikingly different from normal that the resulting image is rather disturbing. Was that boosted in post processing? I wonder if a different blanket with less prominent texture would be an improvement.', '2009-05-03 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465549, 786576, 81362, '<td valign="top">Was this taken through a tube with a set of mirrors, like a kalidesope without the color endpiece?</td>', 'Was this taken through a tube with a set of mirrors, like a kalidesope without the color endpiece?', '2009-05-03 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465553, 786891, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks the way some people describe as the result of drinking too many of those.</td>', 'Looks the way some people describe as the result of drinking too many of those.', '2009-05-03 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465562, 786496, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sharp detail. Perhaps an adjustment to increase brightnes would be good.</td>', 'Sharp detail. Perhaps an adjustment to increase brightnes would be good.', '2009-05-03 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465716, 786767, 101256, '<td valign="top">The slight green cast to this image keeps it from being a complete technical success - the green intrudes on the male lion and give it a grainy appearance even thought it''s not grain. Additionally, the DOF control is a little lacking - it would have been better choice to use a wider angle to capture the entire action and sharpen up the foreground. An artistic success in that it conveys the impression the author wanted to express.</td>', 'The slight green cast to this image keeps it from being a complete technical success - the green intrudes on the male lion and give it a grainy appearance even thought it''s not grain. Additionally, the DOF control is a little lacking - it would have been better choice to use a wider angle to capture the entire action and sharpen up the foreground. An artistic success in that it conveys the impression the author wanted to express.', '2009-05-03 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465737, 786787, 81362, '<td valign="top">Making an artistic image out of junk in the woods is not easy. Use of diagonal composition, richness of colors, and soft light all combine to excellent effect. I wonder why the headrests are not as deteriorated as the rest of the seat.</td>', 'Making an artistic image out of junk in the woods is not easy. Use of diagonal composition, richness of colors, and soft light all combine to excellent effect. I wonder why the headrests are not as deteriorated as the rest of the seat.', '2009-05-03 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465738, 785946, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well-framed character, thoughtful photographic study with good use of light and reflections.</td>', 'Well-framed character, thoughtful photographic study with good use of light and reflections.', '2009-05-03 16:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465739, 786603, 81362, '<td valign="top">Most original zebra image I''ve seen in a long time and unusual processing fits well. Far from the usual characteristics of typical DPC ribbon winners, but one of my top ten for this challenge, despite my thinking that about 1/3 of the area between the lower edge and the closest foot could have been cropped away to good effect.</td>', 'Most original zebra image I''ve seen in a long time and unusual processing fits well. Far from the usual characteristics of typical DPC ribbon winners, but one of my top ten for this challenge, despite my thinking that about 1/3 of the area between the lower edge and the closest foot could have been cropped away to good effect.', '2009-05-03 16:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465740, 786793, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and competent execution. Suffers a point or two from overfamiliarity of eagle head pictures. Difficult to pin down a more constructive comment because I haven''t clarified internally all my thinking about the overlap and differences of technical craft and photographic art.</td>', 'Nice detail and competent execution. Suffers a point or two from overfamiliarity of eagle head pictures. Difficult to pin down a more constructive comment because I haven''t clarified internally all my thinking about the overlap and differences of technical craft and photographic art.', '2009-05-03 16:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465743, 784780, 81362, '<td valign="top">Intimate pose and genuine smiles make a pleasing combination. Light jacket and dark coat do well in a black and white rendering.</td>', 'Intimate pose and genuine smiles make a pleasing combination. Light jacket and dark coat do well in a black and white rendering.', '2009-05-03 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465744, 786924, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sharply focused on the eyes with nice curve of green against black. Wish for just a little more depth of field. Good job overall.</td>', 'Sharply focused on the eyes with nice curve of green against black. Wish for just a little more depth of field. Good job overall.', '2009-05-03 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465747, 786794, 81362, '<td valign="top">Black and white with subtle color tone works well here. Wonderful capture expressive of considerable personality among the subjects.</td>', 'Black and white with subtle color tone works well here. Wonderful capture expressive of considerable personality among the subjects.', '2009-05-03 16:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465751, 786978, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good for you to capture the wall, door, peeling pain, and reflected image of dance and then to enter this rich image rather than any more direct photos of the woman. It takes a strong photographer to look away from an obvious "main subject" and find such a visually captivating alternative.</td>', 'Good for you to capture the wall, door, peeling pain, and reflected image of dance and then to enter this rich image rather than any more direct photos of the woman. It takes a strong photographer to look away from an obvious "main subject" and find such a visually captivating alternative.', '2009-05-03 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465755, 786670, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fine still life entry with dark tones and soft unidirectional light echoing older European paintings.</td>', 'Fine still life entry with dark tones and soft unidirectional light echoing older European paintings.', '2009-05-03 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465759, 785966, 81362, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable simplicity and symmetry. Level of detail appreciated along with the gradual fade out of the stem.</td>', 'Enjoyable simplicity and symmetry. Level of detail appreciated along with the gradual fade out of the stem.', '2009-05-03 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465774, 786887, 101256, '<td valign="top">A competant capture from a technical standpoint, it is overly tall and could use a very strong crop of the top of the image. This over tall condition distracts the viewer''s eye from the more interesting elements in the image and affects it negatively. A solid image in concept that could have used a wider angle lens and a little longer focus. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A competant capture from a technical standpoint, it is overly tall and could use a very strong crop of the top of the image. This over tall condition distracts the viewer''s eye from the more interesting elements in the image and affects it negatively. A solid image in concept that could have used a wider angle lens and a little longer focus. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465787, 786881, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it doesn''t quite match the technical quality. While rich in detail and properly composed the dark nature of the subject fails to impress. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it doesn''t quite match the technical quality. While rich in detail and properly composed the dark nature of the subject fails to impress. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
