(5465827, 786952, 101256, '<td valign="top">The grayscale image with colored elements is fast becoming a meme in these challenges and it doesn''t always work. The repetition of this type of image is fast becoming passe''. Having said that, this is very different and unigue - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'The grayscale image with colored elements is fast becoming a meme in these challenges and it doesn''t always work. The repetition of this type of image is fast becoming passe''. Having said that, this is very different and unigue - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
