(5465833, 786911, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 17:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465836, 786938, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that falls just short of being crisp, sharp, but it is properly framed and composed - a technical success with a couple of minor issues. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail, but the rather odd turn of sky color isn''t as effective as it could be. In general a good effort.</td>', 'A solid image that falls just short of being crisp, sharp, but it is properly framed and composed - a technical success with a couple of minor issues. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail, but the rather odd turn of sky color isn''t as effective as it could be. In general a good effort.', '2009-05-03 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465860, 786576, 101256, '<td valign="top">As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. It might have worked better with a more focused primary image with less grain and highlights. The rather odd angle of the images is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right image would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.</td>', 'As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. It might have worked better with a more focused primary image with less grain and highlights. The rather odd angle of the images is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right image would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.', '2009-05-03 17:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
