(5465968, 786866, 101256, '<td valign="top">Woulda, coulda, shoulda. This image would have been a top contender from both a technical and artistic standpoint if only it had been more sharply focused or if a different filter effect, such as the use of gauze or Vaseline on the lens to create a more "gothic" effect had been used. An image that could have been a contender if more creativity had been used in composition.</td>', 'Woulda, coulda, shoulda. This image would have been a top contender from both a technical and artistic standpoint if only it had been more sharply focused or if a different filter effect, such as the use of gauze or Vaseline on the lens to create a more "gothic" effect had been used. An image that could have been a contender if more creativity had been used in composition.', '2009-05-03 18:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465970, 786652, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because it''s more of a snapshot quality image.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because it''s more of a snapshot quality image.', '2009-05-03 18:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465982, 786423, 101256, '<td valign="top">This has a rather Escher stairs feel to it that is very unique. It suffers from a rather soft focus, but the colors, shadows and odd angle help to overcome that feeling. From an artistsic standpoint, it is a terrific concept and one that is not often seen. A little more focus would have given this a true Escher stairs impression and would have placed well.</td>', 'This has a rather Escher stairs feel to it that is very unique. It suffers from a rather soft focus, but the colors, shadows and odd angle help to overcome that feeling. From an artistsic standpoint, it is a terrific concept and one that is not often seen. A little more focus would have given this a true Escher stairs impression and would have placed well.', '2009-05-03 18:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465986, 785219, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very different and unigue - a vision of beauty and grace - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Very different and unigue - a vision of beauty and grace - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 18:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465992, 780106, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed if just appears to be softer focus than it could be. Good colors and an effective composition. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed if just appears to be softer focus than it could be. Good colors and an effective composition. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 18:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466001, 786148, 101256, '<td valign="top">As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. It might have worked better with a more focused approach with less grain and highlights. The rather odd angle of the image is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right angle or composition would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.</td>', 'As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. It might have worked better with a more focused approach with less grain and highlights. The rather odd angle of the image is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right angle or composition would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.', '2009-05-03 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466003, 780613, 79386, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field</td>', 'Great depth of field', '2009-05-03 18:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466005, 784693, 101256, '<td valign="top">As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. The rather odd angle of the image is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right image would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.</td>', 'As photographers, sometimes we have what we think is a good idea that just doesn''t quite work the way it was intended - this is a pretty good example of that concept. The rather odd angle of the image is rather distracting and not terribly effective. While a good idea, it failed on execution. Having said that, it is a technique to keep in mind for the future - some patience looking for the right image would be in order for this technique to be truly technically and artistically effective.', '2009-05-03 18:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
