(5466017, 785046, 101256, '<td valign="top">Minimalist imagery is always appreciated. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Minimalist imagery is always appreciated. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 18:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466018, 786994, 101256, '<td valign="top">Minimalist imagery is always appreciated. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done. PS: Bathe - not bath. :&gt;)</td>', 'Minimalist imagery is always appreciated. A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done. PS: Bathe - not bath. :>)', '2009-05-03 18:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466021, 781548, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 18:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466026, 782535, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way with a singular exception - the image seems rather flat and dull - perhaps it was intended that way, but it''s not effective. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way with a singular exception - the image seems rather flat and dull - perhaps it was intended that way, but it''s not effective. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466054, 783887, 101256, '<td valign="top">The temptation when viewing images like this is to evaluate it as a "cute" image rather than with a critical eye. In this case, it works both ways - it is both cute and a complete technical success at the same time. That also applies to it''s artistic success - a free form image properly composed and captured demonstrating mastery of light and framing. While probably not to everyone''s taste, it is very effective and absoutely not a snapshot, but a pure portrait quality image. Very well done.</td>', 'The temptation when viewing images like this is to evaluate it as a "cute" image rather than with a critical eye. In this case, it works both ways - it is both cute and a complete technical success at the same time. That also applies to it''s artistic success - a free form image properly composed and captured demonstrating mastery of light and framing. While probably not to everyone''s taste, it is very effective and absoutely not a snapshot, but a pure portrait quality image. Very well done.', '2009-05-03 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466056, 785258, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-03 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466060, 785878, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'A solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
