(5466183, 782345, 3102, '<td valign="top">I just enjoyed my first beignet there in March.  What a popular place!</td>', 'I just enjoyed my first beignet there in March.  What a popular place!', '2009-05-03 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466187, 780190, 101256, '<td valign="top">Impressionist imagery is hard to develop a feel for both when composing and evaluating. In this instance, it''s hard to determine exactly what the author was trying to convey and the technique isn''t as obvious as it should be. Effective in several ways, it fails to have total impact because of it''s very subtle nature - a little less subtlety would have improved it''s impact.</td>', 'Impressionist imagery is hard to develop a feel for both when composing and evaluating. In this instance, it''s hard to determine exactly what the author was trying to convey and the technique isn''t as obvious as it should be. Effective in several ways, it fails to have total impact because of it''s very subtle nature - a little less subtlety would have improved it''s impact.', '2009-05-03 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466192, 786615, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that is properly framed and composed but less than crisp and sharp as it should be for an action image. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image that is properly framed and composed but less than crisp and sharp as it should be for an action image. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
