(5466361, 786609, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way including a very effective black and white conversion. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image of an everyday street scene. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way including a very effective black and white conversion. From an artistic standpoint, it is an interesting image of an everyday street scene. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466367, 786975, 102581, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity!  Great picture.  I would like it even more without the gimmick.  For me, it''s an 8 with the yellow flower and a 9/10 without...</td>', 'Fantastic clarity!  Great picture.  I would like it even more without the gimmick.  For me, it''s an 8 with the yellow flower and a 9/10 without...', '2009-05-03 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466369, 783507, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed although it could be a little lighter exposure. The image also suffers from the "tunnel" macro effect - meaning that the center of the image is in focus, but the foreground and background have DOF problems. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed although it could be a little lighter exposure. The image also suffers from the "tunnel" macro effect - meaning that the center of the image is in focus, but the foreground and background have DOF problems. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466370, 783881, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
