(5466374, 785673, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed there appears to be a little less focused than it should be. The greens are properly controlled which is always a problem for digital cameras. A little wider look at this scene would have helped the focusing issue and/or a higher ISO with a wider aperature. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed there appears to be a little less focused than it should be. The greens are properly controlled which is always a problem for digital cameras. A little wider look at this scene would have helped the focusing issue and/or a higher ISO with a wider aperature. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466375, 786430, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466376, 785910, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466379, 783035, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 21:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466383, 786913, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A little more tracking would have increased it''s interest factor in particular if the author could have pulled off a properly focused subject with motion in the foreground and background.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A little more tracking would have increased it''s interest factor in particular if the author could have pulled off a properly focused subject with motion in the foreground and background.', '2009-05-03 21:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466384, 786905, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good preservation of detail in the dark rocks at the bottom. Red rock country makes life difficult with range of brightness often exceeding sensor capability.</td>', 'Good preservation of detail in the dark rocks at the bottom. Red rock country makes life difficult with range of brightness often exceeding sensor capability.', '2009-05-03 21:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466385, 786788, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although software can correct for wide lens distortion, the effect is rather fun in this image.</td>', 'Although software can correct for wide lens distortion, the effect is rather fun in this image.', '2009-05-03 21:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466388, 786843, 101256, '<td valign="top">A naturalists delight, this is a very effective image - one that is very worthy of a NatGeo photo shoot. The artistic impact is very impressive - the sense of curiosity in the snake is almost palpable. The nicely detailed head is exquisite and demonstrates the various ways Mother Nature gives her creatures character. A very effective image that may not be to everyone''s taste. Well done.</td>', 'A naturalists delight, this is a very effective image - one that is very worthy of a NatGeo photo shoot. The artistic impact is very impressive - the sense of curiosity in the snake is almost palpable. The nicely detailed head is exquisite and demonstrates the various ways Mother Nature gives her creatures character. A very effective image that may not be to everyone''s taste. Well done.', '2009-05-03 21:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466395, 784917, 81362, '<td valign="top">Bright white blouse on shoulder draws eye away from the face, where shadows confuse the issue. On the other hand, the face looks plastic to the extent that I wonder if this is a real person or a clothing mannequin. I''ve seen that look in live people, so I won''t blame it on post processing (unless you confess), but either way the end result is far from beauty.</td>', 'Bright white blouse on shoulder draws eye away from the face, where shadows confuse the issue. On the other hand, the face looks plastic to the extent that I wonder if this is a real person or a clothing mannequin. I''ve seen that look in live people, so I won''t blame it on post processing (unless you confess), but either way the end result is far from beauty.', '2009-05-03 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466397, 785446, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite a great perspective. Nice capture.</td>', 'Quite a great perspective. Nice capture.', '2009-05-03 21:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466400, 786872, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice color on the water. Might consider cropping out upper sky to elimiate the contrail and give more prominence to the water and boat.</td>', 'Nice color on the water. Might consider cropping out upper sky to elimiate the contrail and give more prominence to the water and boat.', '2009-05-03 21:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466403, 784901, 60047, '<td valign="top">Awwww! Great expression. The shadow vs the brightness are just a tad distracting.</td>', 'Awwww! Great expression. The shadow vs the brightness are just a tad distracting.', '2009-05-03 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466404, 785946, 97166, '<td valign="top">For years, he had brought Granny to all his games, and for years they had commended him for his dedication to the old woman. Had praised him for his loving and caring nature. Had honored him for the love he must have for the old woman.<br/> <br/>Of course, eventually, they found him out, and his good name was forever sullied.  It just amazed them that they hadn''t figured it out for so long, nor why she always wore those mirrored glasses, even on rainy days, but they were just all the more angry for their shame.</td>', 'For years, he had brought Granny to all his games, and for years they had commended him for his dedication to the old woman. Had praised him for his loving and caring nature. Had honored him for the love he must have for the old woman. Of course, eventually, they found him out, and his good name was forever sullied.  It just amazed them that they hadn''t figured it out for so long, nor why she always wore those mirrored glasses, even on rainy days, but they were just all the more angry for their shame.', '2009-05-03 21:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466405, 786811, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Your crop is providing a neat effect.</td>', 'Great capture. Your crop is providing a neat effect.', '2009-05-03 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466408, 786949, 60047, '<td valign="top">High highs and dark darks. Neat effect. Interesting expression.</td>', 'High highs and dark darks. Neat effect. Interesting expression.', '2009-05-03 21:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466410, 784780, 96534, '<td valign="top">This is a really lovely shot, the warm tones compliment the warmth between the couple, and the angle is great</td>', 'This is a really lovely shot, the warm tones compliment the warmth between the couple, and the angle is great', '2009-05-03 21:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466412, 784069, 97166, '<td valign="top">And so it was that he knew that he had hit the photographic jackpot, the day he stumbled upon that hidden land.  As he walked among them and took the shots he knew would rocket him to stardom in the photography world, he could hardly contain his awe and wonder.<br/> <br/>For he had stumbled upon the land of the giant horses, and things would never be the same.</td>', 'And so it was that he knew that he had hit the photographic jackpot, the day he stumbled upon that hidden land.  As he walked among them and took the shots he knew would rocket him to stardom in the photography world, he could hardly contain his awe and wonder. For he had stumbled upon the land of the giant horses, and things would never be the same.', '2009-05-03 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466413, 786032, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. I would prefer a bit of a brighter light on the subject (just being picky). Good composition.</td>', 'Nice detail. I would prefer a bit of a brighter light on the subject (just being picky). Good composition.', '2009-05-03 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466415, 786648, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the indigo color.</td>', 'Love the indigo color.', '2009-05-03 21:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466416, 783390, 81362, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the colors, but can''t take my eyes off the composition (partly because of the colors). Potential candidate for hanging in a modern art gallery. I''ll vote 7 for orginiality and impact, but predict a lower end result in the DPC enviroment. Hope your notes tell more about your intent.</td>', 'I don''t like the colors, but can''t take my eyes off the composition (partly because of the colors). Potential candidate for hanging in a modern art gallery. I''ll vote 7 for orginiality and impact, but predict a lower end result in the DPC enviroment. Hope your notes tell more about your intent.', '2009-05-03 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466419, 786670, 96534, '<td valign="top">very beautifully done</td>', 'very beautifully done', '2009-05-03 21:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466420, 784228, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is something of a quandry as this is almost an identical image to a blue ribbon winner in a previous specific challenge. It''s technically and artistically perfect and an image worthy of a National Geographic photo shoot - the difference between this and the previous image is a very minor change in capture angle. As the image has been validated (an error in this reviewer''s opinion) the rules must be followed and appropriate rating of a ten to honor the technical and artistic perfection must be given.  Well done.</td>', 'This is something of a quandry as this is almost an identical image to a blue ribbon winner in a previous specific challenge. It''s technically and artistically perfect and an image worthy of a National Geographic photo shoot - the difference between this and the previous image is a very minor change in capture angle. As the image has been validated (an error in this reviewer''s opinion) the rules must be followed and appropriate rating of a ten to honor the technical and artistic perfection must be given.  Well done.', '2009-05-03 21:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466421, 786612, 81362, '<td valign="top">Saw a group of working cowhands earlier this month in SW Utah, with almost no similarity to this soft urban critter. Ignoring the title, very good portrait nonetheless.</td>', 'Saw a group of working cowhands earlier this month in SW Utah, with almost no similarity to this soft urban critter. Ignoring the title, very good portrait nonetheless.', '2009-05-03 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466422, 785885, 96534, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot, the colours and textures are great, and the puppy is extremely cute :-)</td>', 'I just love this shot, the colours and textures are great, and the puppy is extremely cute :-)', '2009-05-03 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466425, 786974, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way although the image is a little too tall- it might have been more effective if the image had been cropped right to the edge of the top cloud. The cloud effect against the glass is nearly transparent and that is a huge plus in terms of artistic quality for this reviewer. Well done.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way although the image is a little too tall- it might have been more effective if the image had been cropped right to the edge of the top cloud. The cloud effect against the glass is nearly transparent and that is a huge plus in terms of artistic quality for this reviewer. Well done.', '2009-05-03 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466427, 785153, 81362, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t appreciate motorbike jump pictures, but this one really captures well a sense of exhileration. Nice to have interesting clouds that help the composition. Would like to see it without the building in the image, but realize choices are limited in such situations.</td>', 'Normally I don''t appreciate motorbike jump pictures, but this one really captures well a sense of exhileration. Nice to have interesting clouds that help the composition. Would like to see it without the building in the image, but realize choices are limited in such situations.', '2009-05-03 21:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466428, 785070, 97166, '<td valign="top">They knew that their world was in trouble the moment the giant mystical beast had chosen their land, and had plucked it from the earth where it had stood for all their known history.   They had tried their very best to prepare themselves, to set themselves for the coming catastrophe that they had seen happen to so many other lands that had been around them before.<br/> <br/>Now, now it was their turn, and they braced for coming apocalypse.<br/> <br/>Then, with a mighty storming of winds, the giant creature blew out an epic breath, and they held on for dear life, desperately trying to resist the cyclonic forces that would rip them from their world.<br/> <br/>Miraculously, most of them managed to do so, this time. Most of them, that is, but one, and with a heart-wrenching shriek and cry of despair, the little fluff lost her strength of limb and will, and was blown clean off the face of the land, to be carried off to whatever end was to be her fate, and they never saw her again.</td>', 'They knew that their world was in trouble the moment the giant mystical beast had chosen their land, and had plucked it from the earth where it had stood for all their known history.   They had tried their very best to prepare themselves, to set themselves for the coming catastrophe that they had seen happen to so many other lands that had been around them before. Now, now it was their turn, and they braced for coming apocalypse. Then, with a mighty storming of winds, the giant creature blew out an epic breath, and they held on for dear life, desperately trying to resist the cyclonic forces that would rip them from their world. Miraculously, most of them managed to do so, this time. Most of them, that is, but one, and with a heart-wrenching shriek and cry of despair, the little fluff lost her strength of limb and will, and was blown clean off the face of the land, to be carried off to whatever end was to be her fate, and they never saw her again.', '2009-05-03 21:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466429, 784183, 101256, '<td valign="top">An incredible portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail almost in homage to some of the great clasical artists of the Romantic Period. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'An incredible portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail almost in homage to some of the great clasical artists of the Romantic Period. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 21:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466430, 786194, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks ready for publication as a magazine illustration or advertisement for eye makeup.</td>', 'Looks ready for publication as a magazine illustration or advertisement for eye makeup.', '2009-05-03 21:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
