(5466496, 784495, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a stunner. Great composition. Great colors.</td>', 'This is a stunner. Great composition. Great colors.', '2009-05-03 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466497, 786942, 57460, '<td valign="top">Simple yet beautiful!  Good job!</td>', 'Simple yet beautiful!  Good job!', '2009-05-03 22:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466499, 785910, 60047, '<td valign="top">Dang! What a specimen. Nice capture. Great colors in the hair.</td>', 'Dang! What a specimen. Nice capture. Great colors in the hair.', '2009-05-03 22:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466502, 786520, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between the lightness of the buildings and the darkness of the sky.</td>', 'Interesting contrast between the lightness of the buildings and the darkness of the sky.', '2009-05-03 22:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466503, 786977, 76598, '<td valign="top">I really like this, simple but elegant, good leading lines, perfect composition, not over processed</td>', 'I really like this, simple but elegant, good leading lines, perfect composition, not over processed', '2009-05-03 22:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466505, 779227, 60047, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot. I look forward to reading what you have to say about it when voting ends.</td>', 'What an interesting shot. I look forward to reading what you have to say about it when voting ends.', '2009-05-03 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466506, 782104, 81362, '<td valign="top">I hate the smell of these things, as well as what they do to health. On the other hand, holding all that aside, this is an elegantly lit uncluttered image in which even the wiff of smoke contributes a nice curve echoing the ash tray, wich is a pretty unusual and interesting object iteself. Good job.</td>', 'I hate the smell of these things, as well as what they do to health. On the other hand, holding all that aside, this is an elegantly lit uncluttered image in which even the wiff of smoke contributes a nice curve echoing the ash tray, wich is a pretty unusual and interesting object iteself. Good job.', '2009-05-03 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466508, 780862, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2009-05-03 22:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466511, 782296, 57460, '<td valign="top">What a cute owl - too sad about his eye.  Great shot</td>', 'What a cute owl - too sad about his eye.  Great shot', '2009-05-03 22:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466512, 784998, 101256, '<td valign="top">An incredible image that superlatives just cannot properly describe - there aren''t enough words in the English language to do this image justice. Incredible - well done.</td>', 'An incredible image that superlatives just cannot properly describe - there aren''t enough words in the English language to do this image justice. Incredible - well done.', '2009-05-03 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466513, 784759, 57460, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot!</td>', 'Wow, great shot!', '2009-05-03 22:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466514, 786163, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466517, 786845, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract in concept, but impressionist in effect, this is another amazing image of a common, everyday flower. The monotone effect is very effective and gives an impression more artistic than photographic. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should rate fairly high if not a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Abstract in concept, but impressionist in effect, this is another amazing image of a common, everyday flower. The monotone effect is very effective and gives an impression more artistic than photographic. A very worthy entry into the challenge and one that should rate fairly high if not a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466518, 786724, 60047, '<td valign="top">Good job at getting the focus on the subject. Nice DOF management, too.</td>', 'Good job at getting the focus on the subject. Nice DOF management, too.', '2009-05-03 22:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466520, 786609, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great "classic" appeal.</td>', 'Great "classic" appeal.', '2009-05-03 22:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466521, 785478, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image in that everything has been properly controlled - from lighting to framing to artistic effect. A excellant entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image in that everything has been properly controlled - from lighting to framing to artistic effect. A excellant entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466522, 785423, 57460, '<td valign="top">I love the look on his face!  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the look on his face!  Great shot!', '2009-05-03 22:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466524, 782261, 60047, '<td valign="top">Pretty good management of hard lighting.</td>', 'Pretty good management of hard lighting.', '2009-05-03 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466525, 783768, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Focus is where it needs to be.</td>', 'Nice detail. Focus is where it needs to be.', '2009-05-03 22:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466527, 786616, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.  The bird in the background may be a little distacting from the main subject - but otherwise beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful detail.  The bird in the background may be a little distacting from the main subject - but otherwise beautiful shot!', '2009-05-03 22:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466528, 786554, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color!</td>', 'Beautiful color!', '2009-05-03 22:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466529, 785421, 101256, '<td valign="top">This may sound like a snarky comment, but if, in post processing, the line could have been made less visible, this would have won a ribbon just for being so unique and different. A really good idea and just shy of being perfectly executed. A crop of the bottom giving just the ship kite and sky would have been a better choice in this reviewer''s opinion. A great idea and one that this reviewer will shamelessly steal.</td>', 'This may sound like a snarky comment, but if, in post processing, the line could have been made less visible, this would have won a ribbon just for being so unique and different. A really good idea and just shy of being perfectly executed. A crop of the bottom giving just the ship kite and sky would have been a better choice in this reviewer''s opinion. A great idea and one that this reviewer will shamelessly steal.', '2009-05-03 22:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466531, 786620, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. I would prefer a better "rule of thirds" composition.</td>', 'I like the colors. I would prefer a better "rule of thirds" composition.', '2009-05-03 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466532, 785269, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466535, 784579, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant image that has some minor issues with light blooms, it is still very attractive and effective from both a technical and artistic standpoint. Terrific use of bokeh to compliment the image. A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An excellant image that has some minor issues with light blooms, it is still very attractive and effective from both a technical and artistic standpoint. Terrific use of bokeh to compliment the image. A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466537, 785473, 60047, '<td valign="top">Fascinating composition. I really like this. I like the darkness - although I think it might be better just a tad lighter on her abdomen.</td>', 'Fascinating composition. I really like this. I like the darkness - although I think it might be better just a tad lighter on her abdomen.', '2009-05-03 22:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466540, 782259, 60047, '<td valign="top">The red hair goes well with the green BG.</td>', 'The red hair goes well with the green BG.', '2009-05-03 22:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466542, 786857, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful black and white image that conveys an impression of teh late ''30''s era of photography. An excellant conversion to black and white, it is a terrific demonstration of the zone system and it''s practical application.  A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful black and white image that conveys an impression of teh late ''30''s era of photography. An excellant conversion to black and white, it is a terrific demonstration of the zone system and it''s practical application.  A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466544, 786984, 72670, '<td valign="top">Good title Max. Glad I could help you with it:) No vote.just passing thru.</td>', 'Good title Max. Glad I could help you with it:) No vote.just passing thru.', '2009-05-03 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466545, 781140, 60047, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus. Nice composition. Interesting choice to go B&amp;W.</td>', 'A little soft on the focus. Nice composition. Interesting choice to go B&W.', '2009-05-03 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466546, 782296, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the definition. I think a tighter crop would have worked even better.</td>', 'Love the definition. I think a tighter crop would have worked even better.', '2009-05-03 22:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466550, 785767, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great classic action shot. Great composition. Nice panning effect.</td>', 'A great classic action shot. Great composition. Nice panning effect.', '2009-05-03 22:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466551, 786577, 101256, '<td valign="top">Minimalist with rather strong elements of impressionism, this type of photographic imagery is always appreciated. The image is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich in monotone texture and gradients along with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'Minimalist with rather strong elements of impressionism, this type of photographic imagery is always appreciated. The image is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich in monotone texture and gradients along with excellant detail. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. A top ten image and a very strong contender for a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466552, 786538, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite a neat shot. Worthy of staring at for a while.</td>', 'Quite a neat shot. Worthy of staring at for a while.', '2009-05-03 22:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466553, 786233, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love th title for this shot!</td>', 'Love th title for this shot!', '2009-05-03 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466554, 781871, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant landscape that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant landscape that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466555, 782296, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant animal portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant animal portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466556, 786955, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail - an execllant use of the zone system to create maximum impact in addition of being a welcome demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail - an execllant use of the zone system to create maximum impact in addition of being a welcome demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466559, 784848, 101256, '<td valign="top">A naturalist portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.</td>', 'A naturalist portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466561, 786843, 60047, '<td valign="top">The composition really works, here. A tighter crop, though tempting, would have been a mistake. Focus is spot on.</td>', 'The composition really works, here. A tighter crop, though tempting, would have been a mistake. Focus is spot on.', '2009-05-03 22:36:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5466562, 786614, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image and one that is not often seen. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image and one that is not often seen. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466564, 786614, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Stunning clarity. Great time of day to get the lights in the city.</td>', 'Great capture. Stunning clarity. Great time of day to get the lights in the city.', '2009-05-03 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466566, 782954, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity.</td>', 'Nice clarity.', '2009-05-03 22:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466568, 786848, 60047, '<td valign="top">Awww! what a great capture. Those ears are the stars of the show!</td>', 'Awww! what a great capture. Those ears are the stars of the show!', '2009-05-03 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466570, 786402, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast in the sky. Good PP work.</td>', 'Love the contrast in the sky. Good PP work.', '2009-05-03 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466571, 783390, 101256, '<td valign="top">An extreme example of abstract impressionism, this could very well have been painted by any number of classical masters of the abstract, impressionist or pop art genres. Very clever and different. Probably not to everyone''s taste which may affect it''s overall rating, to this reviewer it demonstrates the power of the digital world and how it can create beautiful and impressive imagery different than the ordinary cookie cutter imagery that is normally produced. A standing O for being very creative. Well done.</td>', 'An extreme example of abstract impressionism, this could very well have been painted by any number of classical masters of the abstract, impressionist or pop art genres. Very clever and different. Probably not to everyone''s taste which may affect it''s overall rating, to this reviewer it demonstrates the power of the digital world and how it can create beautiful and impressive imagery different than the ordinary cookie cutter imagery that is normally produced. A standing O for being very creative. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466572, 781805, 60047, '<td valign="top">Just a little soft on the clarity on the birds. Nice wave crash capture.</td>', 'Just a little soft on the clarity on the birds. Nice wave crash capture.', '2009-05-03 22:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466573, 785995, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 22:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466575, 786755, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Lower left corner is the only anomaly.</td>', 'Great colors. Lower left corner is the only anomaly.', '2009-05-03 22:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466576, 784363, 60047, '<td valign="top">Focus is right on the head - good job.</td>', 'Focus is right on the head - good job.', '2009-05-03 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466577, 784765, 101256, '<td valign="top">Funny and captured with a terrific sense of whimsy - chimps are indeed curious creatures and it is well captured in this image. Very different and unigue - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.</td>', 'Funny and captured with a terrific sense of whimsy - chimps are indeed curious creatures and it is well captured in this image. Very different and unigue - a solid image that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being richly colored with excellant detail. This image would have worked as a black and white as well. A perfect demonstration of the power of properly controlled light and focus. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466578, 784850, 60047, '<td valign="top">Really awesome capture of the sunburst sky coupled with the detail of the beach.</td>', 'Really awesome capture of the sunburst sky coupled with the detail of the beach.', '2009-05-03 22:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466580, 780862, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very different and unique, a classic candid portrait perfectly captured. Nothing more needs to be said - it is a terrific capture and one that the author should be very proud of. Well done.</td>', 'Very different and unique, a classic candid portrait perfectly captured. Nothing more needs to be said - it is a terrific capture and one that the author should be very proud of. Well done.', '2009-05-03 22:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466581, 786496, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like this macro. I think a bit more light would have helped.</td>', 'I like this macro. I think a bit more light would have helped.', '2009-05-03 22:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466583, 784602, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Good exposure management.</td>', 'Nice detail. Good exposure management.', '2009-05-03 22:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466585, 786495, 60047, '<td valign="top">What an interesting idea. Love the orange and black.</td>', 'What an interesting idea. Love the orange and black.', '2009-05-03 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466586, 786768, 60047, '<td valign="top">A poster quality shot. Great work.</td>', 'A poster quality shot. Great work.', '2009-05-03 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466591, 785478, 60047, '<td valign="top">Excellent definition on the rose. Nice deep DOF. A timeless classic here on DPC.</td>', 'Excellent definition on the rose. Nice deep DOF. A timeless classic here on DPC.', '2009-05-03 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466595, 786644, 60047, '<td valign="top">A little heavy on the post processing for my taste - but great blues against the clouds.</td>', 'A little heavy on the post processing for my taste - but great blues against the clouds.', '2009-05-03 22:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466600, 785974, 60047, '<td valign="top">I think the tilt angle works here - it does not appear to be "forced." Nice capture of a moment.</td>', 'I think the tilt angle works here - it does not appear to be "forced." Nice capture of a moment.', '2009-05-03 22:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466602, 786065, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice soft effect.</td>', 'Nice soft effect.', '2009-05-03 22:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466606, 785674, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the bird.</td>', 'Great detail on the bird.', '2009-05-03 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466611, 786499, 60047, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing that you captured him/her in mid flight. Too bad the clarity isn''t sharper.</td>', 'Pretty amazing that you captured him/her in mid flight. Too bad the clarity isn''t sharper.', '2009-05-03 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466613, 785712, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cool shot. I think a tighter crop would have made this even more powerful.</td>', 'Wow, what a cool shot. I think a tighter crop would have made this even more powerful.', '2009-05-03 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466620, 784029, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow, to have captured the haziness of the nebula - pretty impressive.</td>', 'Wow, to have captured the haziness of the nebula - pretty impressive.', '2009-05-03 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466621, 786599, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Very powerful.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Very powerful.', '2009-05-03 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466622, 784183, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between the pinks and the blues.</td>', 'Interesting contrast between the pinks and the blues.', '2009-05-03 22:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466623, 783887, 60047, '<td valign="top">Awww! Love the splash of color provided by the hat.</td>', 'Awww! Love the splash of color provided by the hat.', '2009-05-03 22:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466624, 785047, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great macro capture.</td>', 'Great macro capture.', '2009-05-03 22:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466628, 785008, 60047, '<td valign="top">Neat composition. Love the clarity of focus on the eye.</td>', 'Neat composition. Love the clarity of focus on the eye.', '2009-05-03 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466630, 783415, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of a very shallow DOF.</td>', 'Interesting use of a very shallow DOF.', '2009-05-03 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466642, 786931, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful equine portrait - crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint is has a lot of appeal showing off the character of this beautiful horse. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful equine portrait - crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint is has a lot of appeal showing off the character of this beautiful horse. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466644, 785243, 101256, '<td valign="top">A excellant character portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail demonstrating of the power of properly controlled light and focus and proper use of the zone system to create an artistic impression. Well done.</td>', 'A excellant character portrait that is crisp, sharp and properly framed and composed - a technical success in every way. From an artistic standpoint, it has significant impact being rich with excellant detail demonstrating of the power of properly controlled light and focus and proper use of the zone system to create an artistic impression. Well done.', '2009-05-03 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466648, 786883, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success with a very clever use of bokeh. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the "tunnel" effect where the central part of the image is focused and the rest slightly defocused. A slightly longer look with similar use of bokeh and a sharper foreground would have improved this image tremendously. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid image that is properly framed and composed - a technical success with a very clever use of bokeh. From an artistic standpoint, it is an intersting image but of less than universal appeal because of the "tunnel" effect where the central part of the image is focused and the rest slightly defocused. A slightly longer look with similar use of bokeh and a sharper foreground would have improved this image tremendously. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-03 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466649, 786949, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus in this could be seen as a negative, but the effect is very pleasing to the eye and compliments the model very well. Nicely shadowed with effective lighting, it is a very worthy entry into the challenge. A little sharper focus would have been a good choice, but this works as well.</td>', 'The soft focus in this could be seen as a negative, but the effect is very pleasing to the eye and compliments the model very well. Nicely shadowed with effective lighting, it is a very worthy entry into the challenge. A little sharper focus would have been a good choice, but this works as well.', '2009-05-03 23:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466650, 782058, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very different picture of a little one, this image has two issues - the combination of dark blue tone and the pink jacket don''t work well - a little more exposure of the darker shades would have been a plus. Second, the slight out of focus area on the left doesn''t help the image much - a little better crop would have been a better choice. Stil, a sound entry into the challenge and a different child portrait.</td>', 'A very different picture of a little one, this image has two issues - the combination of dark blue tone and the pink jacket don''t work well - a little more exposure of the darker shades would have been a plus. Second, the slight out of focus area on the left doesn''t help the image much - a little better crop would have been a better choice. Stil, a sound entry into the challenge and a different child portrait.', '2009-05-03 23:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466651, 786617, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow - does she look like a young <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a> or what?!! This is an awesome shot.</td>', 'Wow - does she look like a young  Judi or what?!! This is an awesome shot.', '2009-05-03 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
