(5466707, 786652, 70000, '<td valign="top">This photograph intrigues me. Most probably write this off as lacking technical excellence, but this really makes me think. The flash is harsh, causing the imperfections and the hard dark background to really be accentuated. The cute child is doing something so ordinary and yet the photograph is so unsettling. I like it!</td>', 'This photograph intrigues me. Most probably write this off as lacking technical excellence, but this really makes me think. The flash is harsh, causing the imperfections and the hard dark background to really be accentuated. The cute child is doing something so ordinary and yet the photograph is so unsettling. I like it!', '2009-05-03 23:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466709, 786849, 70000, '<td valign="top">What a unique photo! excellent composition and play with textures.</td>', 'What a unique photo! excellent composition and play with textures.', '2009-05-03 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
