(5466822, 786938, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done with the building and the composition.  I''m not so fond of the sky, the colors seem a bit unnatural.  Just my opinion, of course.  Clever title.</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done with the building and the composition.  I''m not so fond of the sky, the colors seem a bit unnatural.  Just my opinion, of course.  Clever title.', '2009-05-04 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
