(5468778, 786525, 57460, '<td valign="top">Wow - wonderful capture.  I love the texture in the sky and in the rocks.  At first I thought it may look better with the darker right side cropped out, but then after looking at it again, you would have lost the beautiful texture in the rocks on the right, so I wouldn''t change it!  Great level on the horizon.  Wonderful Shot!</td>', 'Wow - wonderful capture.  I love the texture in the sky and in the rocks.  At first I thought it may look better with the darker right side cropped out, but then after looking at it again, you would have lost the beautiful texture in the rocks on the right, so I wouldn''t change it!  Great level on the horizon.  Wonderful Shot!', '2009-05-04 21:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
