(5469073, 785463, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great job on the exposure and bringing out the shadow detail; I''m guessing HDR or maybe Topaz.  I really like those yellow tones.  IMO, to pull this off the symmetry needs to be near perfect, and unfortunately it''s not.</td>', 'Great job on the exposure and bringing out the shadow detail; I''m guessing HDR or maybe Topaz.  I really like those yellow tones.  IMO, to pull this off the symmetry needs to be near perfect, and unfortunately it''s not.', '2009-05-04 23:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469076, 782859, 60047, '<td valign="top">the shadow under the chin reveals a pretty harsh light, here. Beautiful expression and an interesting POV.</td>', 'the shadow under the chin reveals a pretty harsh light, here. Beautiful expression and an interesting POV.', '2009-05-04 23:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469078, 782535, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the desaturation. That being said I think that this would look cool in monochrome</td>', 'Not sure about the desaturation. That being said I think that this would look cool in monochrome', '2009-05-04 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469081, 785947, 60047, '<td valign="top">Butterflies and flowers - a winning combination.</td>', 'Butterflies and flowers - a winning combination.', '2009-05-04 23:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469084, 782859, 66515, '<td valign="top">This shot has a bit of snapshot feeling to it in my opinion. I think that you either need to compose this as a portrait or compose to show more of the story.</td>', 'This shot has a bit of snapshot feeling to it in my opinion. I think that you either need to compose this as a portrait or compose to show more of the story.', '2009-05-04 23:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469091, 786794, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the processing here. Its a little harsh and isn''t very flattering to your subjects I think.</td>', 'Not sure about the processing here. Its a little harsh and isn''t very flattering to your subjects I think.', '2009-05-04 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469094, 779179, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love the concept of this shot and I like the lighting design. Perhaps just a tad too bright on the faces?</td>', 'I love the concept of this shot and I like the lighting design. Perhaps just a tad too bright on the faces?', '2009-05-04 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469095, 779657, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the attitude portrayed here.</td>', 'I like the attitude portrayed here.', '2009-05-04 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469098, 786815, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice form.</td>', 'Nice form.', '2009-05-04 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469099, 786127, 66515, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. You may want to have them pose so you can show just their hands however this works fairly well the way it is. Nice lighting and good handling of exposure.</td>', 'Simple and effective. You may want to have them pose so you can show just their hands however this works fairly well the way it is. Nice lighting and good handling of exposure.', '2009-05-04 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469101, 786952, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite peculiar and enjoyable!</td>', 'Quite peculiar and enjoyable!', '2009-05-04 23:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469102, 784025, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and textures.</td>', 'Love the colors and textures.', '2009-05-04 23:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469108, 784100, 42495, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to like here, but just a bit oversaturated for my taste.</td>', 'There''s a lot to like here, but just a bit oversaturated for my taste.', '2009-05-04 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469111, 780500, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark deep reds on the booth and in her hair. I like the high contrast.</td>', 'I really like the dark deep reds on the booth and in her hair. I like the high contrast.', '2009-05-04 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469114, 782193, 66515, '<td valign="top">I don''t really agree with the choice of title. The disease is hard to show in a photograph since its a mental disease. <br/> <br/>What I see in this photograph is simply an elderly couple. That in itself is enough of a story and makes me want to know more about them.  I like the use of the door to frame them and the bit of the house in the frame gives us an idea of the character of the house too. It makes me believe that this is the house that they''ve lived in most of their lives.</td>', 'I don''t really agree with the choice of title. The disease is hard to show in a photograph since its a mental disease.  What I see in this photograph is simply an elderly couple. That in itself is enough of a story and makes me want to know more about them.  I like the use of the door to frame them and the bit of the house in the frame gives us an idea of the character of the house too. It makes me believe that this is the house that they''ve lived in most of their lives.', '2009-05-04 23:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469120, 784558, 66515, '<td valign="top">interesting pose and I like the subtle lines that draw you towards her face. Great capture of the texture in the sand.</td>', 'interesting pose and I like the subtle lines that draw you towards her face. Great capture of the texture in the sand.', '2009-05-04 23:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469122, 786943, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot. I like the effect of the back lighting.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot. I like the effect of the back lighting.', '2009-05-04 23:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469124, 786194, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great effect. Looks like a stock photo.</td>', 'Great effect. Looks like a stock photo.', '2009-05-04 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469129, 786690, 60047, '<td valign="top">Very serene.</td>', 'Very serene.', '2009-05-04 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469132, 785673, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the stone textures and the moss.</td>', 'Love the stone textures and the moss.', '2009-05-04 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469133, 784029, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the border. I think that borders need to be very simple as they tend to draw your eye away from the image. There purpose, in my opinion is to help "contain" the image.<br/> <br/>That aside, incredible capture and I am in awe of the time and effort it probably took to get this image.</td>', 'Not really a fan of the border. I think that borders need to be very simple as they tend to draw your eye away from the image. There purpose, in my opinion is to help "contain" the image. That aside, incredible capture and I am in awe of the time and effort it probably took to get this image.', '2009-05-04 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469134, 782535, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2009-05-04 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469140, 786038, 66515, '<td valign="top">The parachuter seems to be lacking detail. Not sure if this was deliberate or not but I do find myself wanting to see more of him (her?)</td>', 'The parachuter seems to be lacking detail. Not sure if this was deliberate or not but I do find myself wanting to see more of him (her?)', '2009-05-04 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469141, 785153, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great moment captured.</td>', 'Great moment captured.', '2009-05-04 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469146, 786867, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the expressions on the runners'' faces.</td>', 'Love the expressions on the runners'' faces.', '2009-05-04 23:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469150, 786555, 66515, '<td valign="top">oversharpened in my opinion. The deer''s hair looks bristly and almost "crusty" for lack of a better term. <br/> <br/>The eyes of the deer are definitely engaged with the camera however and because of this there is a strong connection to the viewer.  Excellent DOF and good focus on the eyes.</td>', 'oversharpened in my opinion. The deer''s hair looks bristly and almost "crusty" for lack of a better term.  The eyes of the deer are definitely engaged with the camera however and because of this there is a strong connection to the viewer.  Excellent DOF and good focus on the eyes.', '2009-05-04 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469151, 785967, 60047, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.</td>', 'Cute shot.', '2009-05-04 23:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469153, 783035, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the red &amp; green. Great expression.</td>', 'Love the red & green. Great expression.', '2009-05-04 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469157, 784759, 66515, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Nice detail throughout. Sharp without being overly so. I like the subtle tones in the beak. Great colors. I wonder (just out of curiousity) what this would look like in black and white.</td>', 'Excellent image. Nice detail throughout. Sharp without being overly so. I like the subtle tones in the beak. Great colors. I wonder (just out of curiousity) what this would look like in black and white.', '2009-05-04 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469160, 786615, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great moment captured!</td>', 'Great moment captured!', '2009-05-04 23:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469161, 784024, 66515, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. Beautiful bokeh in the background. Nice focus and sharpness on the water drop. Highlights are bright but not overly so. This is a shot I wish I had taken.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. Beautiful bokeh in the background. Nice focus and sharpness on the water drop. Highlights are bright but not overly so. This is a shot I wish I had taken.', '2009-05-04 23:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469166, 787006, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the deep colors against the night sky.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the deep colors against the night sky.', '2009-05-04 23:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469171, 786554, 60047, '<td valign="top">Quite a well composed shot.</td>', 'Quite a well composed shot.', '2009-05-04 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469174, 786077, 66515, '<td valign="top">strange dodging on the tree. The upper branches are silhouettes while the large branches have detail. I''d consider bracketing exposure and letting HDR software help with filling in the detail.</td>', 'strange dodging on the tree. The upper branches are silhouettes while the large branches have detail. I''d consider bracketing exposure and letting HDR software help with filling in the detail.', '2009-05-04 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469180, 785505, 60047, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Interesting effect. Is this PP or just unusual lighting? I hope you explain in comments.</td>', 'Hmmm...Interesting effect. Is this PP or just unusual lighting? I hope you explain in comments.', '2009-05-04 23:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469182, 786999, 60047, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2009-05-04 23:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469183, 786127, 60047, '<td valign="top">A classic shot done well.</td>', 'A classic shot done well.', '2009-05-04 23:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469187, 786198, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with lots of potential. Unfortunately its a little washed out and overexposed especially in the sky. Levels and curves correction in post processing would definitely help. With the levels corrected, the colors would appear richer and more vibrant. <br/> <br/>Compositionally there isn''t really anything for my eye to rest on. That being said I do see some nice wedge shapes in this image which could be used to anchor the image if you were to shoot from a different angle.</td>', 'Interesting image with lots of potential. Unfortunately its a little washed out and overexposed especially in the sky. Levels and curves correction in post processing would definitely help. With the levels corrected, the colors would appear richer and more vibrant.  Compositionally there isn''t really anything for my eye to rest on. That being said I do see some nice wedge shapes in this image which could be used to anchor the image if you were to shoot from a different angle.', '2009-05-04 23:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469189, 783601, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow. Now that''s an "in your face" flower! Great capture of a common DPC theme.</td>', 'Wow. Now that''s an "in your face" flower! Great capture of a common DPC theme.', '2009-05-04 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469190, 781699, 60047, '<td valign="top">The black BG really works well to show off the flowers.</td>', 'The black BG really works well to show off the flowers.', '2009-05-04 23:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469191, 786868, 60047, '<td valign="top">A magical shot. Nice work.</td>', 'A magical shot. Nice work.', '2009-05-04 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469194, 786949, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Excellent lighting and good focus. Not sure about the expression on her face. (Almost looks like she is chewing something). <br/> <br/>Good separation from the background. I might want to see a bit more light on the right hand side of her head.  (Reflector would help there I think)</td>', 'Great capture. Excellent lighting and good focus. Not sure about the expression on her face. (Almost looks like she is chewing something).  Good separation from the background. I might want to see a bit more light on the right hand side of her head.  (Reflector would help there I think)', '2009-05-04 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469200, 785664, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the expression. Not a fan of the sepia coloring - more of a plain B&amp;W would have been my choice. Nice composition.</td>', 'Love the expression. Not a fan of the sepia coloring - more of a plain B&W would have been my choice. Nice composition.', '2009-05-04 23:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469201, 784849, 60047, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear. Great colors.</td>', 'Crisp and clear. Great colors.', '2009-05-04 23:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469203, 786911, 66515, '<td valign="top">Processing is a bit off here especially with the haloing around the silo and uneven burning in the sky around the trees. Composition is a bit two dimensional as well. I''d be curious to see what this would look like if the buildings were shot at an oblique.</td>', 'Processing is a bit off here especially with the haloing around the silo and uneven burning in the sky around the trees. Composition is a bit two dimensional as well. I''d be curious to see what this would look like if the buildings were shot at an oblique.', '2009-05-04 23:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469204, 779657, 60047, '<td valign="top">Vignette is a little strong. Love the HDR effect. Great concept on this shot.</td>', 'Vignette is a little strong. Love the HDR effect. Great concept on this shot.', '2009-05-04 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469205, 783157, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2009-05-04 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469208, 784919, 60047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures &amp; colors. Impressive DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful textures & colors. Impressive DOF.', '2009-05-04 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469209, 784780, 66515, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene that tells a great story. Background is a little bright but not overly so. The people in the shot are definitely engaged. (i.e. interacting with each other) and you''ve captured the connection between them quite well. Great DOF and good sharpness and focus on the subjects.</td>', 'Beautiful scene that tells a great story. Background is a little bright but not overly so. The people in the shot are definitely engaged. (i.e. interacting with each other) and you''ve captured the connection between them quite well. Great DOF and good sharpness and focus on the subjects.', '2009-05-04 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469210, 786799, 60047, '<td valign="top">Dang! What good fortune to have balloons over the tulips!</td>', 'Dang! What good fortune to have balloons over the tulips!', '2009-05-04 23:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469214, 781665, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The image seems to be a bit dull however and could use some adjustment to levels/curves to bring the whites closer to white. (i.e. the scene appears to be underexposed.)</td>', 'Interesting shot. The image seems to be a bit dull however and could use some adjustment to levels/curves to bring the whites closer to white. (i.e. the scene appears to be underexposed.)', '2009-05-04 23:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469215, 786963, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns in the shadows and the clock is a nice element to tie the whole image together. Nice monochrome look to the picture.</td>', 'I like the patterns in the shadows and the clock is a nice element to tie the whole image together. Nice monochrome look to the picture.', '2009-05-04 23:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469218, 779380, 66515, '<td valign="top">At first glace I was like "WOW!". Unfortunately, I see some glitches in the processing though that take away from this otherwise great image. There is ghosting in the sky and there is a sudden transition between grey and shadow in areas that seem strange. I am guessing that this was a HDR image made from multiple exposures and the images aren''t quite lined up.</td>', 'At first glace I was like "WOW!". Unfortunately, I see some glitches in the processing though that take away from this otherwise great image. There is ghosting in the sky and there is a sudden transition between grey and shadow in areas that seem strange. I am guessing that this was a HDR image made from multiple exposures and the images aren''t quite lined up.', '2009-05-04 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469222, 785673, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with great representation of depth. There is definitely a foreground, mid ground, and background in this image. The paths help take the viewer through the scene. A circular polarize would help reduce some of the glare on the stones but otherwise its great exposure wise. I like the nicely saturated colors.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with great representation of depth. There is definitely a foreground, mid ground, and background in this image. The paths help take the viewer through the scene. A circular polarize would help reduce some of the glare on the stones but otherwise its great exposure wise. I like the nicely saturated colors.', '2009-05-04 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469223, 786610, 42495, '<td valign="top">Back for a bump.  This is my favorite of the challenge and I''ll be disappointed if this doesn''t ribbon.  The technicals are well done, but what makes this for me is the emotional content.</td>', 'Back for a bump.  This is my favorite of the challenge and I''ll be disappointed if this doesn''t ribbon.  The technicals are well done, but what makes this for me is the emotional content.', '2009-05-04 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469224, 786993, 66515, '<td valign="top">Subtle use of depth and I like the line that draws you into the picture. Very subtle but effective.</td>', 'Subtle use of depth and I like the line that draws you into the picture. Very subtle but effective.', '2009-05-04 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469227, 786939, 42495, '<td valign="top">There''s not a lot here to look at, and yet it''s hard to not look.  Well done.</td>', 'There''s not a lot here to look at, and yet it''s hard to not look.  Well done.', '2009-05-04 23:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469228, 786644, 66515, '<td valign="top">The shadow areas don''t have enough detail and highlights are blown out. This might be because the processing is quite harsh. If the processing were toned down a bit and kept to the basics I think we''d see more details and yet you''d still be able to keep the mood that you wanted to convey.</td>', 'The shadow areas don''t have enough detail and highlights are blown out. This might be because the processing is quite harsh. If the processing were toned down a bit and kept to the basics I think we''d see more details and yet you''d still be able to keep the mood that you wanted to convey.', '2009-05-04 23:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469229, 786811, 96881, '<td valign="top">There is something different about thsi photo that appeals.  I like the way you have gone with the negative space int eh left hand side, and the profile portrait of the kid to the right.  The background is very well blurred for this.  I usually am not a fan of this style of work, but you have pulled it off with an exceptionally composed and executed image.</td>', 'There is something different about thsi photo that appeals.  I like the way you have gone with the negative space int eh left hand side, and the profile portrait of the kid to the right.  The background is very well blurred for this.  I usually am not a fan of this style of work, but you have pulled it off with an exceptionally composed and executed image.', '2009-05-04 23:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469230, 786835, 96881, '<td valign="top">I find the processing of this image is a little overdone, giving the entire image a fake feel to it.  This is most evident in the foreground water and the coast line.  While it may have been the effect you were after, it doesn''t work for me.  I like the subject.  Perhaps a little extra space on the right might have balanced the shot a little better</td>', 'I find the processing of this image is a little overdone, giving the entire image a fake feel to it.  This is most evident in the foreground water and the coast line.  While it may have been the effect you were after, it doesn''t work for me.  I like the subject.  Perhaps a little extra space on the right might have balanced the shot a little better', '2009-05-04 23:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469231, 786525, 66515, '<td valign="top">um....wow. Great capture. I look forward to finding out where this was taken.</td>', 'um....wow. Great capture. I look forward to finding out where this was taken.', '2009-05-04 23:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469237, 786112, 96881, '<td valign="top">The clouds in this photo have a fake look to them, probably as a result of the processing you have applied to it.  They look as if they were drawn in.  This is especially evident on the left most building.  The image also lacks colour.  ALl the lights are the same colour in this, and I feel you are too closely cropped in.  Some extra sky, and extra water would have helped, with a possibly large view of the overall skyline.  This then could have seen some reflections in the water, and the building to the right then not being cropped half off.</td>', 'The clouds in this photo have a fake look to them, probably as a result of the processing you have applied to it.  They look as if they were drawn in.  This is especially evident on the left most building.  The image also lacks colour.  ALl the lights are the same colour in this, and I feel you are too closely cropped in.  Some extra sky, and extra water would have helped, with a possibly large view of the overall skyline.  This then could have seen some reflections in the water, and the building to the right then not being cropped half off.', '2009-05-04 23:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469246, 784425, 96881, '<td valign="top">And forever changed the course of history.<br/> <br/>The noise in the image detracts from the overall shot.  It would have been hard to capture with all the smoke around in the battlescene.  The man in front of the shooter adds nothing to the image, except he gets in the way of the shooter.  Of course, its not a composed shot, but one taken of the action, however it does affect considerably the overall image.</td>', 'And forever changed the course of history. The noise in the image detracts from the overall shot.  It would have been hard to capture with all the smoke around in the battlescene.  The man in front of the shooter adds nothing to the image, except he gets in the way of the shooter.  Of course, its not a composed shot, but one taken of the action, however it does affect considerably the overall image.', '2009-05-04 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469249, 786307, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition of this shot, however, the subjects are too dark.  They needed some light reflected onto them to make them stand out more, as attention is currently drawn by the background sunset as the couple are quite dark compared to the rest of the scene.  A slight change int he angle they are at may also have helped, allowing us to see part of her face.<br/> <br/>Also, what shoes is he wearing?????</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition of this shot, however, the subjects are too dark.  They needed some light reflected onto them to make them stand out more, as attention is currently drawn by the background sunset as the couple are quite dark compared to the rest of the scene.  A slight change int he angle they are at may also have helped, allowing us to see part of her face. Also, what shoes is he wearing?????', '2009-05-04 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469252, 786977, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image.  Very plain in colour, very basic, and yet extremely effective.  The shapes of the fence and its shaddows cast a simple pattern that makes this image really work.  The composition is really good.  The border compliments the photo very well.  A very good and different submission</td>', 'A very interesting image.  Very plain in colour, very basic, and yet extremely effective.  The shapes of the fence and its shaddows cast a simple pattern that makes this image really work.  The composition is really good.  The border compliments the photo very well.  A very good and different submission', '2009-05-05 00:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469257, 784035, 88204, '<td valign="top">Adorable child, fun expression, pose and outfit, beautiful light. My only nitpick is the wrinkles on the background. Might be nice to selectively blur the background to reduce the hard wrinkles. Wonderful portrait. 9</td>', 'Adorable child, fun expression, pose and outfit, beautiful light. My only nitpick is the wrinkles on the background. Might be nice to selectively blur the background to reduce the hard wrinkles. Wonderful portrait. 9', '2009-05-05 00:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469258, 780791, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beatiful compositon, pose and most of all, beautiful light. Well done. 9</td>', 'Beatiful compositon, pose and most of all, beautiful light. Well done. 9', '2009-05-05 00:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469260, 784917, 88204, '<td valign="top">Stunning subject, love the solemn expression. My only criticism is that I wish there was a hint more light on her face and eyes.</td>', 'Stunning subject, love the solemn expression. My only criticism is that I wish there was a hint more light on her face and eyes.', '2009-05-05 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469262, 786610, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting location. Beatiful light. 9</td>', 'Very interesting location. Beatiful light. 9', '2009-05-05 00:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
