(5469441, 784100, 63633, '<td valign="top">The blue of his eyes is so striking that it prompts a closer look, but on further inspection your processing is a little clumsy. The blue in the left eye (the baby''s right) has crept out of the iris. If you had been a little more subtle with the colour enhancement, I probably wouldn''t have noticed it.<br/> <br/>The composition of the image is really nce.</td>', 'The blue of his eyes is so striking that it prompts a closer look, but on further inspection your processing is a little clumsy. The blue in the left eye (the baby''s right) has crept out of the iris. If you had been a little more subtle with the colour enhancement, I probably wouldn''t have noticed it. The composition of the image is really nce.', '2009-05-05 01:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469459, 786799, 63633, '<td valign="top">An incredible image - a stand-out winner in a very strong free study. If this doesn''t get the blue I''ll be stunned.</td>', 'An incredible image - a stand-out winner in a very strong free study. If this doesn''t get the blue I''ll be stunned.', '2009-05-05 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469463, 782104, 63633, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is incredible. I imagine that you won''t score as high as you deserve because of the subject matter, but this is a beautiful image of an ugly subject. 9</td>', 'Your lighting is incredible. I imagine that you won''t score as high as you deserve because of the subject matter, but this is a beautiful image of an ugly subject. 9', '2009-05-05 02:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
