(5469618, 784425, 24486, '<td valign="top">This one looked rather interesting as a thumbnail but I see you have a lot of digital noise. If you want to make the noise work for you, try making the photograph sepia. Then noise turns into artistic grain. An effect I quite like. Incendently, as much fun as it is to go to these events, if there is smoke around, be wary of where the smoke is. Cameras &amp; smoke don''t always go together.</td>', 'This one looked rather interesting as a thumbnail but I see you have a lot of digital noise. If you want to make the noise work for you, try making the photograph sepia. Then noise turns into artistic grain. An effect I quite like. Incendently, as much fun as it is to go to these events, if there is smoke around, be wary of where the smoke is. Cameras & smoke don''t always go together.', '2009-05-05 04:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469624, 786454, 24486, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. The only distraction is the light in the top right corner. The whole scene looks so peaceful.</td>', 'Very nicely captured. The only distraction is the light in the top right corner. The whole scene looks so peaceful.', '2009-05-05 04:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
