(5470000, 782801, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice photo but could be improved quite easily.<br/>She is a beautiful bride but the picture seems to be more about the dress.<br/>Things I would change (and this is only my opinion - I''m not a pro...)<br/>First, straighten the verticals then crop some from the top, bottom and left hand side. Make sure those windows are removed even if it means losing a little off the dress. (If the dress flows off the bottom of the picture it will still look impressive to the viewer, who may then think it was even longer.!)<br/>Some of the details in the dress look blown out - these may be recoverable from a ''raw'' file. If not it''s a case of getting the exposure right at the time of capture.      Good luck</td>', 'nice photo but could be improved quite easily.She is a beautiful bride but the picture seems to be more about the dress.Things I would change (and this is only my opinion - I''m not a pro...)First, straighten the verticals then crop some from the top, bottom and left hand side. Make sure those windows are removed even if it means losing a little off the dress. (If the dress flows off the bottom of the picture it will still look impressive to the viewer, who may then think it was even longer.!)Some of the details in the dress look blown out - these may be recoverable from a ''raw'' file. If not it''s a case of getting the exposure right at the time of capture.      Good luck', '2009-05-05 11:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5470009, 785674, 92577, '<td valign="top">great shot that may benefit from an adjustment to levels and saturation .</td>', 'great shot that may benefit from an adjustment to levels and saturation .', '2009-05-05 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
