(5475066, 782193, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poignant.  Think I''d have cropped out the door entirely, though she could be frowning because she can''t get outside, I just don''t think it adds enough to the story and I''d like to zoom right in on their expressions.</td>', 'Poignant.  Think I''d have cropped out the door entirely, though she could be frowning because she can''t get outside, I just don''t think it adds enough to the story and I''d like to zoom right in on their expressions.', '2009-05-07 17:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475070, 785946, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-05-07 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475083, 784228, 68586, '<td valign="top">Totally magnificent and deserving of the front page in any challenge. The attention to detail, focus and control of colour and light are simply at a professional level.<br/> <br/>A photograph without fault or blemish.<br/> <br/>p.s. glad I''m not the little guy . .</td>', 'Totally magnificent and deserving of the front page in any challenge. The attention to detail, focus and control of colour and light are simply at a professional level. A photograph without fault or blemish. p.s. glad I''m not the little guy . .', '2009-05-07 17:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475085, 786982, 68586, '<td valign="top">Picture postcard perfect . .</td>', 'Picture postcard perfect . .', '2009-05-07 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475088, 785446, 68586, '<td valign="top">neat idea and nice control of the lighting.</td>', 'neat idea and nice control of the lighting.', '2009-05-07 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
