(5475582, 779257, 96534, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is just lovely, as are the colours. The only thing is that there isn''t an identifiable focal point in sharp focus, possibly due to the light (I''m assuming you focused on the shed, but its a bit hazy). Was it taken in the middle of the day? Perhaps earlier or later might bring out more clarity and allow you to really grab the eye to either the forward daffodils or the shed</td>', 'The composition of this shot is just lovely, as are the colours. The only thing is that there isn''t an identifiable focal point in sharp focus, possibly due to the light (I''m assuming you focused on the shed, but its a bit hazy). Was it taken in the middle of the day? Perhaps earlier or later might bring out more clarity and allow you to really grab the eye to either the forward daffodils or the shed', '2009-05-07 21:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475586, 786996, 96534, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose on this shot, but it is just that tiny bit too dark, making the silhouette soft and the eye struggles to see the power of the image. Its so nearly there, but an adjustment in curves might bring it out a little better, whilst still retaining the moody dark feeling</td>', 'I really like the pose on this shot, but it is just that tiny bit too dark, making the silhouette soft and the eye struggles to see the power of the image. Its so nearly there, but an adjustment in curves might bring it out a little better, whilst still retaining the moody dark feeling', '2009-05-07 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
