(5475596, 782880, 96534, '<td valign="top">there is so much you can do with this scene, I would really encourage you to go back there and keep shooting it. A longer exposure would bring a silkiness to the water, and those poles could be captured as the focal point, with less sky and more city in the background.</td>', 'there is so much you can do with this scene, I would really encourage you to go back there and keep shooting it. A longer exposure would bring a silkiness to the water, and those poles could be captured as the focal point, with less sky and more city in the background.', '2009-05-07 21:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
