(5475616, 786939, 30364, '<td valign="top">When I first looked upon this I thought you were wrong.  I thought it was an ode.  But you''re right after all; it''s a ballad.  Simple, folksy, and beautifully musical.  Nice composition too; panels of light and dark; love and loss; optimism and despair.  The nails in the wall suggest something sad took place here, like a quiet, slow crucifixion.</td>', 'When I first looked upon this I thought you were wrong.  I thought it was an ode.  But you''re right after all; it''s a ballad.  Simple, folksy, and beautifully musical.  Nice composition too; panels of light and dark; love and loss; optimism and despair.  The nails in the wall suggest something sad took place here, like a quiet, slow crucifixion.', '2009-05-07 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5475621, 786986, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s so beautifully tantalising, as if the entire photograph is a reluctant gesture.  It might be this, it might be that.  It''s quiet, and cautious, and resigned.  And so it is sad and sweet at once. A moving hint of something gone.</td>', 'It''s so beautifully tantalising, as if the entire photograph is a reluctant gesture.  It might be this, it might be that.  It''s quiet, and cautious, and resigned.  And so it is sad and sweet at once. A moving hint of something gone.', '2009-05-07 21:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
