(5475663, 786967, 30364, '<td valign="top">A lovely, heroic vision.  Something in the nature of a Revelation, in fact.  There''s a shadow of a corporeal form, and a column of some transcendent vitality being liberated from its core.  The classical admixture of God and mortal man, reality and myth.  It''s a quite beautiful vision, and repays with interest every moment spent in its contemplation.<br/> <br/>A worthy ultimate recipient of the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A lovely, heroic vision.  Something in the nature of a Revelation, in fact.  There''s a shadow of a corporeal form, and a column of some transcendent vitality being liberated from its core.  The classical admixture of God and mortal man, reality and myth.  It''s a quite beautiful vision, and repays with interest every moment spent in its contemplation. A worthy ultimate recipient of the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-05-07 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
