(5476097, 783390, 81362, '<td valign="top">Yipes! Well maybe some people savor the "brown ribbon" status, but I can hardly believe this entry ended there. Still, notice the average from commenters. Thanks for the background information. In the future, I''ll be more careful and not predict "lower end result", at least to avoid any residual guilt from possibly issuing a jinx.</td>', 'Yipes! Well maybe some people savor the "brown ribbon" status, but I can hardly believe this entry ended there. Still, notice the average from commenters. Thanks for the background information. In the future, I''ll be more careful and not predict "lower end result", at least to avoid any residual guilt from possibly issuing a jinx.', '2009-05-08 01:23:02.000000', NULL, 0),
