(5476207, 786821, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s the straw which ruins the picture I think. As you said in your details, the feather has great texture and fantastic stripes. But the straw does considerably distract from it. It''s the strongest in the bottom right corner because it is in the foreground and drags the eye away from the feather. Of course, like the other commenters said before me, you could diminish this effect with post-processing. But unless you are a photoshop god, it stays a weak composition.</td>', 'It''s the straw which ruins the picture I think. As you said in your details, the feather has great texture and fantastic stripes. But the straw does considerably distract from it. It''s the strongest in the bottom right corner because it is in the foreground and drags the eye away from the feather. Of course, like the other commenters said before me, you could diminish this effect with post-processing. But unless you are a photoshop god, it stays a weak composition.', '2009-05-08 03:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
