(5476320, 782347, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this - mostly for her expression, but what gives it added depth are the faces behind her.  Just barely there, but there just the same.  One distinctly male, one distinctly female - one can assume these are the bunny''s proud parents.  An engaging and delightfully different "family portrait" of a sort.  My only nit (and you know this is coming) is the selective desat, but that''s a personal preference - pure B&amp;W would work just fine for me.  But it''s not my picture, now, is it?  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this - mostly for her expression, but what gives it added depth are the faces behind her.  Just barely there, but there just the same.  One distinctly male, one distinctly female - one can assume these are the bunny''s proud parents.  An engaging and delightfully different "family portrait" of a sort.  My only nit (and you know this is coming) is the selective desat, but that''s a personal preference - pure B&W would work just fine for me.  But it''s not my picture, now, is it?  Nicely done.', '2009-05-08 07:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476321, 786788, 51538, '<td valign="top">I rather liked the Escher-esque nature of this photo and the HDR or whatever process that revealed into the shadows.  9 from me.</td>', 'I rather liked the Escher-esque nature of this photo and the HDR or whatever process that revealed into the shadows.  9 from me.', '2009-05-08 07:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476322, 786801, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perfectly lovely photo, IMO. 9 from me.  Glad you entered it.</td>', 'Perfectly lovely photo, IMO. 9 from me.  Glad you entered it.', '2009-05-08 07:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476323, 785015, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good action indeed - that back fellow looks like he''s getting swamped in the wake of the front one!</td>', 'Very good action indeed - that back fellow looks like he''s getting swamped in the wake of the front one!', '2009-05-08 07:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
