(5476325, 786921, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked it just fine.  To me it was a lovely soothing interlude while trying to get enough votes in to count.  This one made me pause to enjoy.</td>', 'I liked it just fine.  To me it was a lovely soothing interlude while trying to get enough votes in to count.  This one made me pause to enjoy.', '2009-05-08 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
