(5476333, 785664, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really think this is outstanding.  How anyone could give this a 1, 2, or 3 is absolutely beyond me.  Great work Art, especially as this is outside your comfort zone of fantastic landscapes.</td>', 'I really think this is outstanding.  How anyone could give this a 1, 2, or 3 is absolutely beyond me.  Great work Art, especially as this is outside your comfort zone of fantastic landscapes.', '2009-05-08 07:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
