(5476336, 785473, 67152, '<td valign="top">Mac- Great image.  I like the tough look, the dark and subtle lighting.  I think people need to get their monitors calibrated if they think it is too dark.</td>', 'Mac- Great image.  I like the tough look, the dark and subtle lighting.  I think people need to get their monitors calibrated if they think it is too dark.', '2009-05-08 07:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
