(5476348, 784759, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great job Mark.  For this one, you need to look at the Commenters score and forget that other one.  This is a great image and you have every right to be proud of it.  I don''t understand how anyone can give this a low score.</td>', 'Great job Mark.  For this one, you need to look at the Commenters score and forget that other one.  This is a great image and you have every right to be proud of it.  I don''t understand how anyone can give this a low score.', '2009-05-08 07:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
