(5476435, 786793, 67152, '<td valign="top">Awesome image. I think this is evidence that it is good to listen to your wife more often.  She seems to have an eye for this place....<br/> <br/>The details and energy of the image are outstanding, the expression is classic, and the delivery from a technical point of view is flawless.</td>', 'Awesome image. I think this is evidence that it is good to listen to your wife more often.  She seems to have an eye for this place.... The details and energy of the image are outstanding, the expression is classic, and the delivery from a technical point of view is flawless.', '2009-05-08 09:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476436, 786536, 3724, '<td valign="top">Enjoy this reflected playful skyline.</td>', 'Enjoy this reflected playful skyline.', '2009-05-08 09:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
