(5476443, 786610, 54799, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2009-05-08 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476446, 784078, 67152, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Is it just me or is there a screen-like effect/pixelation in this?  I was trying to figure it out during voting... (didn''t vote on it for that reason).  Great pose! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is an interesting observations that Deb makes.  I saw the pixelation on one computer/monitor and not another...very strange stuff....<br/> <br/>This is a GREAT image - the close crop, the head on flight, the kinetic feel, and the complementary colors of the bird and the background to emphasize the stealth-like qualities of this magnificant bird.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Is it just me or is there a screen-like effect/pixelation in this?  I was trying to figure it out during voting... (didn''t vote on it for that reason).  Great pose!   It is an interesting observations that Deb makes.  I saw the pixelation on one computer/monitor and not another...very strange stuff.... This is a GREAT image - the close crop, the head on flight, the kinetic feel, and the complementary colors of the bird and the background to emphasize the stealth-like qualities of this magnificant bird.', '2009-05-08 09:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
