(5476535, 786307, 67152, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and beautiful scene.  Your work is always so polished. <br/> <br/>I just wonder in this case whether the centered placement of the couple and the fact that the woman''s face is turned away cost you a bit of on the score.  The far left side of the image does not seem to provide as much of the ''good stuff'' that the couple and the right provide.  But then again...what do I know...you''re the pro!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-08 09:25:06.</i></td>', 'Lovely lighting and beautiful scene.  Your work is always so polished.  I just wonder in this case whether the centered placement of the couple and the fact that the woman''s face is turned away cost you a bit of on the score.  The far left side of the image does not seem to provide as much of the ''good stuff'' that the couple and the right provide.  But then again...what do I know...you''re the pro!', '2009-05-08 10:24:15.000000', '2009-05-08 10:25:06.000000', 0),
(5476536, 786619, 73142, '<td valign="top">The shooter does not need her permission to put this online. It was taken in the public eye. If anyone can see it, so can we. By the way, nice grab shot.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blue Moon:</b></div><hr/><i> hmm, I had to stare at this for a while (and not for the obvious reason). Don''t see too much that is artistic here and I''m pretty sure that the girl in the background looks like she wants to kick your ass. It also looks like this was done out of blatant drunkeness. That makes me wonder if you got her permission to put this online. A lot to wonder about here, but not to much to really see. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'The shooter does not need her permission to put this online. It was taken in the public eye. If anyone can see it, so can we. By the way, nice grab shot. Originally posted by Blue Moon: hmm, I had to stare at this for a while (and not for the obvious reason). Don''t see too much that is artistic here and I''m pretty sure that the girl in the background looks like she wants to kick your ass. It also looks like this was done out of blatant drunkeness. That makes me wonder if you got her permission to put this online. A lot to wonder about here, but not to much to really see. ', '2009-05-08 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5476537, 786799, 67152, '<td valign="top">A hearty congratulations on this great image and the well deserved Blue.  The level of details and wonderfully rich colors that you were able to pull out and deliver at 720 and &lt;200kb is almost unimaginable.</td>', 'A hearty congratulations on this great image and the well deserved Blue.  The level of details and wonderfully rich colors that you were able to pull out and deliver at 720 and <200kb is almost unimaginable.', '2009-05-08 10:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
