(5476586, 786984, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of this guys face.  Makes me wonder what it is he''s thinking... makes me happy just looking at his face.  Composition is great, though, I feel there might not be enough contrast between his hair and the background, so the eye wanders a little into the wall... perhaps a touch shallower DOF to blur the background might have helped prevent this... but I''m just looking for things to pick on really.  An excellent image, which I expected to finish higher than it did.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the expression of this guys face.  Makes me wonder what it is he''s thinking... makes me happy just looking at his face.  Composition is great, though, I feel there might not be enough contrast between his hair and the background, so the eye wanders a little into the wall... perhaps a touch shallower DOF to blur the background might have helped prevent this... but I''m just looking for things to pick on really.  An excellent image, which I expected to finish higher than it did.  Well done.', '2009-05-08 10:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
