(5476596, 782347, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  I didn''t get around to voting on this one, but this would have been up there as one of my favourite portraits of the challenge.  Expression is priceless.  I don''t mind the selective de-sat at all... works for me.  What I''d have to pick on would be the crop that loses part of the bunny ear and part of her right arm.  I think this might have done better had we not just had the "Candid" challenge... Very nice.  Keep up the great work.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  I didn''t get around to voting on this one, but this would have been up there as one of my favourite portraits of the challenge.  Expression is priceless.  I don''t mind the selective de-sat at all... works for me.  What I''d have to pick on would be the crop that loses part of the bunny ear and part of her right arm.  I think this might have done better had we not just had the "Candid" challenge... Very nice.  Keep up the great work.', '2009-05-08 10:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
