(5476791, 786102, 67152, '<td valign="top">A quiet and gentle image - realistic, worn, and abandoned - nicely composed with excellent details throughout.  This is one of those images that gets completely lost among the bright and shiny, the overt colors and in your face animal shots - but this has so much room for us to meander, so much earthy appeal of the rural landscape.  Very nice work Karen.</td>', 'A quiet and gentle image - realistic, worn, and abandoned - nicely composed with excellent details throughout.  This is one of those images that gets completely lost among the bright and shiny, the overt colors and in your face animal shots - but this has so much room for us to meander, so much earthy appeal of the rural landscape.  Very nice work Karen.', '2009-05-08 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 0),
