(5476903, 786821, 80908, '<td valign="top">This is also a great example of a picture which gets better the more you look at it, which doesn''t work so well on a DP Challenge where most voters will give it about 30 seconds... more contrast to make the components stand out will help grab that fleeting attention.<br/> <br/>Alternatively, photograph it for you and accept the score which is definitely more purist! For myself, I would be curious to see this picture with the feather diagonally bottom left to top right in almost a square crop processed much as you have, although with maybe a touch more contrast.  How did you do the BW conversion?</td>', 'This is also a great example of a picture which gets better the more you look at it, which doesn''t work so well on a DP Challenge where most voters will give it about 30 seconds... more contrast to make the components stand out will help grab that fleeting attention. Alternatively, photograph it for you and accept the score which is definitely more purist! For myself, I would be curious to see this picture with the feather diagonally bottom left to top right in almost a square crop processed much as you have, although with maybe a touch more contrast.  How did you do the BW conversion?', '2009-05-08 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
