(5477197, 784889, 58691, '<td valign="top">It is the lack of detail in the door window and the overall darkness of the right side (angled down to the door)that would cause me to give it a 5. The trailing lines of the wall that are not straight would also be a factor - I do see that the lines of the door are perfectly horizontal and vertical. A slight skew in pp would clear that up without messing with the lines of the door. The greenish-hue of the wall makes for a somewhat blah overall image and works against the graffiti colors. <br/></td>', 'It is the lack of detail in the door window and the overall darkness of the right side (angled down to the door)that would cause me to give it a 5. The trailing lines of the wall that are not straight would also be a factor - I do see that the lines of the door are perfectly horizontal and vertical. A slight skew in pp would clear that up without messing with the lines of the door. The greenish-hue of the wall makes for a somewhat blah overall image and works against the graffiti colors. ', '2009-05-08 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
