(5477249, 780113, 67145, '<td valign="top">wow lydia .. this is a brilliant bee shot ... he''s such an interesting little bee, quite different from the little honey bees we get around here .. i love the excellent details you''ve captured and his incredibly sharp eyes .. :)<br/>ps .. thankyou for your comment on my robberfly .. i reckon i copped a bashing from the ppl who didnt like seeing the same scene twice .. 12 votes of 3 and under, 5 of them 1''s .. i cant understand how ppl can think a photograph is worthy of a ribbon in one challenge and then a very similar one is less than ordinary in another .. especially when its the free study .. :)</td>', 'wow lydia .. this is a brilliant bee shot ... he''s such an interesting little bee, quite different from the little honey bees we get around here .. i love the excellent details you''ve captured and his incredibly sharp eyes .. :)ps .. thankyou for your comment on my robberfly .. i reckon i copped a bashing from the ppl who didnt like seeing the same scene twice .. 12 votes of 3 and under, 5 of them 1''s .. i cant understand how ppl can think a photograph is worthy of a ribbon in one challenge and then a very similar one is less than ordinary in another .. especially when its the free study .. :)', '2009-05-08 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
