(5477295, 782296, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by landon1013:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Great, but ease up on the sharpening. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You know this was actually almost as shoot on the sharpening.  I think I ran noise ninja once on it<br/> <br/>Also this bird isn''t winking it is indeed missing an eye. poor bird. :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fair enough. I was noticing the halos around his feathers against the bright (but very nice!) background -- also the textures in his face struck me as a bit rough. Great shot though. I do love owls. Too bad about his eye.</td>', 'Originally posted by landon1013: Originally posted by bvy: Great, but ease up on the sharpening.   You know this was actually almost as shoot on the sharpening.  I think I ran noise ninja once on it Also this bird isn''t winking it is indeed missing an eye. poor bird. :(   Fair enough. I was noticing the halos around his feathers against the bright (but very nice!) background -- also the textures in his face struck me as a bit rough. Great shot though. I do love owls. Too bad about his eye.', '2009-05-08 18:21:08.000000', NULL, 0),
