(5477585, 786799, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome shot! Glad to see you show your talent away from the bridge. :)  Also great to see you up in my neck of the woods. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I have been in your neck of the woods for three times (count in previously this one <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=707315" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_707315.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_707315.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_707315.jpg"/></a> and virtually this one <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=710072" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_710072.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_710072.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_710072.jpg"/></a>, LOL). Maybe someday we gonna bump into each other with cameras on hands.</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo: Awesome shot! Glad to see you show your talent away from the bridge. :)  Also great to see you up in my neck of the woods.  I have been in your neck of the woods for three times (count in previously this one  and virtually this one , LOL). Maybe someday we gonna bump into each other with cameras on hands.', '2009-05-08 23:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
