(5487806, 786576, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow I can''t believe this scored so low!  I bet if you had something pretty in there, say maybe about 3 aurora boreali (is that the plural?!?  hehe) you would have at least reached a 5 :P<br/> <br/>I appreciate your ingenuity with your photography.  Your work really makes people think, and I do believe that "thinking" is an element that gets lost during voting in the big challenges.</td>', 'Wow I can''t believe this scored so low!  I bet if you had something pretty in there, say maybe about 3 aurora boreali (is that the plural?!?  hehe) you would have at least reached a 5 :P I appreciate your ingenuity with your photography.  Your work really makes people think, and I do believe that "thinking" is an element that gets lost during voting in the big challenges.', '2009-05-15 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
