(5497010, 785318, 89223, '<td valign="top">i saw this photo in the challenge be4 and ment to come back to leave a comment but time as it always does slips trought the cracks of my hands, anyway i happy i fould you and this photo again, i think your photo is very beautiful, the plant is very well places in the frame and the colors are very vibrant for being soft shades, i think maybe having the colored flower two flowers to the left and haveing this one in b/w might have helped this score wise an bit better and maybe a softer shade of pink for the boarder it tends to draw my eye (imo)  but either way i love this photo as is very nicely done i would love to see it huge on canvis im sure that would be very nice lol great job!</td>', 'i saw this photo in the challenge be4 and ment to come back to leave a comment but time as it always does slips trought the cracks of my hands, anyway i happy i fould you and this photo again, i think your photo is very beautiful, the plant is very well places in the frame and the colors are very vibrant for being soft shades, i think maybe having the colored flower two flowers to the left and haveing this one in b/w might have helped this score wise an bit better and maybe a softer shade of pink for the boarder it tends to draw my eye (imo)  but either way i love this photo as is very nicely done i would love to see it huge on canvis im sure that would be very nice lol great job!', '2009-05-23 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
