(5506382, 786619, 56502, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kcm:</b></div><hr/><i> The shooter does not need her permission to put this online. It was taken in the public eye.  </i></td></tr></table> <br/>At least here in Germany that isn''t be true, she still has the rights regarding the image of herself (as well as the bystanders) - strictly speaking you would need a model release of all people that can be recognised. On the other hand, she doesn''t look like she would care much.</td>', 'Originally posted by kcm: The shooter does not need her permission to put this online. It was taken in the public eye.   At least here in Germany that isn''t be true, she still has the rights regarding the image of herself (as well as the bystanders) - strictly speaking you would need a model release of all people that can be recognised. On the other hand, she doesn''t look like she would care much.', '2009-05-31 09:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5506408, 786619, 60047, '<td valign="top">In regard to the release issue, they were also filming a documentary at this music festival. Upon entering the property there were huge legal disclaimer signs warning that your voluntary entrance to the park was also giving legal authority to being filmed. <br/> <br/>I''m pretty sure this additional legal disclaimer was unnecessary for me to legally post this shot here in the states.</td>', 'In regard to the release issue, they were also filming a documentary at this music festival. Upon entering the property there were huge legal disclaimer signs warning that your voluntary entrance to the park was also giving legal authority to being filmed.  I''m pretty sure this additional legal disclaimer was unnecessary for me to legally post this shot here in the states.', '2009-05-31 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5508473, 779269, 39427, '<td valign="top">Man, I never pull my camera out on the subway - gotta get over that fear.  You''re put in proximity to some very interesting stuff, as this shot attests to.  Nice work, DoF heightens the impact, and the person in the distant top left corner glancing over seals the deal.</td>', 'Man, I never pull my camera out on the subway - gotta get over that fear.  You''re put in proximity to some very interesting stuff, as this shot attests to.  Nice work, DoF heightens the impact, and the person in the distant top left corner glancing over seals the deal.', '2009-06-01 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
