(5553722, 786863, 106576, '<td valign="top">David,<br/>First I like the composition and the colors, very nice and the vertical is very interesting. I also don''t know that much french but if it does say "THREE purple tulips" then I would have to agree that the Depth of field should be including the other two flowers. Yet I also like  the emphasizing of the middle one here with a different name, hope that doesn''t come across too picky!<br/>Just my thoughts.</td>', 'David,First I like the composition and the colors, very nice and the vertical is very interesting. I also don''t know that much french but if it does say "THREE purple tulips" then I would have to agree that the Depth of field should be including the other two flowers. Yet I also like  the emphasizing of the middle one here with a different name, hope that doesn''t come across too picky!Just my thoughts.', '2009-07-01 15:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
