(5641915, 786618, 71886, '<td valign="top">I like where you put him in this one.  My favorite part is the pinks in the background.  This photo may benefit if you actually zoomed out and had the branch exiting the photo on the top vertical third, rather than in the corner.</td>', 'I like where you put him in this one.  My favorite part is the pinks in the background.  This photo may benefit if you actually zoomed out and had the branch exiting the photo on the top vertical third, rather than in the corner.', '2009-09-09 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
